#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Dense matrices and vectors for MoonBit in immutable and in-place forms, with checked numerical routines and capability traits for generic linear algebra."
msgstr "面向 MoonBit 的稠密矩阵与向量库，提供不可变与原地修改两种形式，并配有受检数值例程和用于泛型线性代数的能力 trait。"

