msgstr "这些名称重新导出 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的受检运算，它们返回 `Result`，而不是 IEEE 特殊值。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:107
msgid "The local traits `CheckedSqrt`, `CheckedDiv` and `CheckedCompare` below delegate to them for `Float` and `Double`."
msgstr "下文的本地 trait `CheckedSqrt`、`CheckedDiv` 和 `CheckedCompare` 在 `Float` 和 `Double` 上委托给它们。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:112
msgid "These re-export the types that the checked operations take and return."
msgstr "这些名称重新导出受检运算所接收和返回的类型。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:124
msgid "precision and rounding settings; build it with `ArithmeticContext::new(precision)`"
msgstr "精度与舍入设置；用 `ArithmeticContext::new(precision)` 构造"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:125
msgid "structured scalar error with fields `kind` and `message`"
msgstr "带有字段 `kind` 和 `message` 的结构化标量错误"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:150
msgid "Absolute value"
msgstr "绝对值"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:154
msgid "`Abs` marks scalar types with an absolute value."
msgstr "`Abs` 标记具有绝对值的标量类型。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:167
msgid "`Abs::abs` returns $|x|$."
msgstr "`Abs::abs` 返回 $|x|$。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:173
msgid "The implementations delegate to `Num::abs` of `luna-generic`. For `Int`, $|-2^{31}|$ wraps to $-2^{31}$, as in two's-complement arithmetic."
msgstr "这些实现委托给 `luna-generic` 的 `Num::abs`。对于 `Int`，$|-2^{31}|$ 会按补码算术回绕为 $-2^{31}$。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:189
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:115
msgid "Approximate equality"
msgstr "近似相等"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:193
msgid "`ApproxEq` marks scalar types with an approximate comparison."
msgstr "`ApproxEq` 标记支持近似比较的标量类型。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:206
msgid "`ApproxEq::approx_eq` reports whether two values are within a fixed absolute tolerance of each other."
msgstr "`ApproxEq::approx_eq` 判断两个值之差是否在固定的绝对容差之内。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:213
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:219
msgid "The tolerance is absolute, so it is too strict for large magnitudes and too loose for tiny ones, and the relation is not transitive. It returns `false` whenever an operand is NaN, and for an infinity compared with itself ($\\infty - \\infty$ is NaN). See the [design page](../design/arithmetic.md) for the consequences."
msgstr "该容差是绝对的，因此对大数值过严、对极小数值过松，而且该关系不具有传递性。只要有操作数是 NaN 就返回 `false`；无穷与其自身比较时也返回 `false`（$\\infty - \\infty$ 是 NaN）。其后果见[设计页面](../design/arithmetic.md)。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:240
msgid "Checked operations"
msgstr "受检运算"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:242
msgid "The checked traits return `Result[_, ArithmeticError]` instead of a NaN or an infinity. The implementations for `Float` and `Double` delegate to the upstream `DivChecked`, `SqrtChecked` and `CompareChecked` traits; they accept an `ArithmeticContext` for interface uniformity but ignore it, because hardware binary floating point has a fixed precision."
msgstr "受检 trait 返回 `Result[_, ArithmeticError]`，而不是 NaN 或无穷大。`Float` 和 `Double` 的实现委托给上游的 `DivChecked`、`SqrtChecked` 和 `CompareChecked` trait；为了接口统一，它们接受一个 `ArithmeticContext`，但会忽略它，因为硬件二进制浮点数的精度是固定的。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:250
msgid "`CheckedDiv` marks scalar types with a division that reports invalid operands."
msgstr "`CheckedDiv` 标记具有能报告非法操作数的除法的标量类型。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:262
msgid "`CheckedDiv::checked_div(x, y, ctx)` returns `Ok(x / y)` or an error."
msgstr "`CheckedDiv::checked_div(x, y, ctx)` 返回 `Ok(x / y)` 或一个错误。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:268
msgid "Operands"
msgstr "操作数"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:268
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:270
#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:271
msgid "`Err`, kind `DomainError`"
msgstr "`Err`，kind 为 `DomainError`"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:272
msgid ""
"$x / 0$, $x \\n"
"e 0$ (also for $x = \\infty$ or NaN)"
msgstr ""
"$x / 0$，$x \\n"
"e 0$（$x = \\infty$ 或 NaN 时亦然）"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:272
msgid "`Err`, kind `DivisionByZero`"
msgstr "`Err`，kind 为 `DivisionByZero`"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:273
msgid "otherwise"
msgstr "其他情况"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:273
msgid "`Ok(x / y)`, rounded to nearest; NaN operands give `Ok(NaN)`"
msgstr "`Ok(x / y)`，舍入到最近值；NaN 操作数得到 `Ok(NaN)`"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:277
msgid "`CheckedSqrt` marks scalar types with a square root that reports domain errors."
msgstr "`CheckedSqrt` 标记具有能报告定义域错误的平方根的标量类型。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:289
msgid "`CheckedSqrt::checked_sqrt(x, ctx)` returns `Ok(√x)` for $x \\ge 0$ and an error with kind `DomainError` for $x < 0$."
msgstr "`CheckedSqrt::checked_sqrt(x, ctx)` 在 $x \\ge 0$ 时返回 `Ok(√x)`，在 $x < 0$ 时返回 kind 为 `DomainError` 的错误。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:296
msgid "A NaN argument is passed through as `Ok(NaN)`."
msgstr "NaN 参数会原样传递为 `Ok(NaN)`。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:300
msgid "`CheckedCompare` marks scalar types with a three-way comparison that reports unordered operands."
msgstr "`CheckedCompare` 标记具有能报告无序操作数的三路比较的标量类型。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:313
msgid "`CheckedCompare::checked_compare(x, y)` returns `Ok(-1)`, `Ok(0)` or `Ok(1)` for $x < y$, $x = y$ and $x > y$, and an error with kind `UnorderedComparison` when either operand is NaN."
msgstr "`CheckedCompare::checked_compare(x, y)` 在 $x < y$、$x = y$ 和 $x > y$ 时分别返回 `Ok(-1)`、`Ok(0)` 或 `Ok(1)`，当任一操作数为 NaN 时返回 kind 为 `UnorderedComparison` 的错误。"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:321
msgid "The three checked traits together:"
msgstr "三个受检 trait 的综合示例："

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:351
msgid "Where the traits are used"
msgstr "这些 trait 的使用位置"

#: manual/api/arithmetic.md:353
msgid "The concrete matrix packages take their scalar bounds from `luna-generic` (`Zero`, `AddMonoid`, `Semiring`, `Field`, `Num`) and from `Sqrt`. The `@mutable` numerical routines use `Sqrt` through this re-export and their own `Tolerance` trait (see the [`mutable` API](mutable.md#tolerance)). The local traits `Abs`, `ApproxEq` and the checked traits are building blocks for downstream algorithms; no matrix method of this repository requires them."
msgstr "具体的矩阵包从 `luna-generic`（`Zero`、`AddMonoid`、`Semiring`、`Field`、`Num`）以及 `Sqrt` 获取标量约束。`@mutable` 的数值例程通过此处的重导出使用 `Sqrt`，并使用它们自己的 `Tolerance` trait（见 [`mutable` API](mutable.md#tolerance)）。本地 trait `Abs`、`ApproxEq` 以及各受检 trait 是供下游算法使用的构件；本仓库中没有任何矩阵方法依赖它们。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:1
msgid "backends/default API"
msgstr "backends/default API"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/backends/default` is the reference dense backend. It wraps the concrete `@mutable` and `@immut` types in four owned structs and implements the [`algebra`](../algebra.md) traits for them, so that generic code bounded by those traits runs on real dense data. It also provides three trait-bounded helper functions and a few backend methods (`scale`, `dot`, `axpy`, `matvec`)."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/backends/default` 是参考稠密后端。它用四个自有结构体包装具体的 `@mutable` 和 `@immut` 类型，并为它们实现 [`algebra`](../algebra.md) trait，使受这些 trait 约束的泛型代码能够在真实的稠密数据上运行。它还提供三个受 trait 约束的辅助函数以及若干后端方法（`scale`、`dot`、`axpy`、`matvec`）。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:12
msgid "Source: [`src/backends/default`](../../../../src/backends/default/types.mbt). Why the wrappers exist is explained in the [backends/default design](../../design/backends/default.md)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/backends/default`](../../../../src/backends/default/types.mbt)。包装类型存在的原因见 [backends/default 设计](../../design/backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:26
msgid "The examples on this page write every name with its package prefix, such as `@default.`, instead of a `using` declaration: all pages of this manual compile into one test package, where the declarations of different pages would clash."
msgstr "本页示例中的每个名称都带上包前缀（如 `@default.`），而不使用 `using` 声明：本手册的所有页面会编译进同一个测试包，不同页面的声明会相互冲突。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:31
#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:33
msgid "Wrapper"
msgstr "包装类型"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:33
msgid "Wraps"
msgstr "被包装类型"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:33
msgid "Semantics"
msgstr "语义"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:35
msgid "shares the wrapped vector; results of operators are new vectors"
msgstr "共享被包装的向量；运算符的结果是新向量"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:36
msgid "shares the wrapped matrix; results of operators are new matrices"
msgstr "共享被包装的矩阵；运算符的结果是新矩阵"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:37
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:38
msgid "value semantics"
msgstr "值语义"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:40
msgid "All operators return a new wrapper around a new inner value; none mutates its operands. Shape mismatches in operators abort, as in the wrapped types."
msgstr "所有运算符都返回一个包裹新内部值的新包装对象；没有运算符会修改其操作数。与被包装类型一样，运算符中的形状不匹配会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:43
msgid "Generic helpers"
msgstr "泛型辅助函数"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:47
msgid "`shape_of(m)` returns `(rows, cols)` of any `MatrixShape` value."
msgstr "`shape_of(m)` 返回任意 `MatrixShape` 值的 `(rows, cols)`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:55
msgid "`transpose(m)` returns the transpose of any `TransposeMatrix` value, of the same type."
msgstr "`transpose(m)` 返回任意 `TransposeMatrix` 值的转置，类型与原值相同。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:64
msgid "`matmul(a, b)` returns `a * b` for any `MatMulMatrix` type."
msgstr "`matmul(a, b)` 对任意 `MatMulMatrix` 类型返回 `a * b`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:70
msgid "The precondition $\\operatorname{cols}(a) = \\operatorname{rows}(b)$ and the failure behaviour are those of the type's `*`; for the dense wrappers a mismatch aborts."
msgstr "前置条件 $\\operatorname{cols}(a) = \\operatorname{rows}(b)$ 以及失败时的行为都由该类型的 `*` 决定；对于稠密包装类型，不匹配会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:89
msgid "`DenseVector[T]` is the mutable dense vector wrapper."
msgstr "`DenseVector[T]` 是可变稠密向量的包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:97
msgid "The field is readable from other packages. Implemented traits: `Add`, `Neg`, `Sub` and `Mul` (element-wise) under the element constraints of the methods below, `@algebra.VectorShape` for all `T`, `@algebra.AdditiveVector` when `T : Add + Neg`, and `@algebra.VecMulVector` when `T : Add + Neg + Mul`."
msgstr "该字段可从其他包读取。已实现的 trait：在下列方法的元素约束下的 `Add`、`Neg`、`Sub` 和 `Mul`（按元素），对所有 `T` 实现的 `@algebra.VectorShape`，当 `T : Add + Neg` 时的 `@algebra.AdditiveVector`，以及当 `T : Add + Neg + Mul` 时的 `@algebra.VecMulVector`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:105
msgid "`DenseVector::from_array(xs)` wraps a new `@mutable.Vector` built from `xs`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::from_array(xs)` 包装一个由 `xs` 构建的新 `@mutable.Vector`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:111
msgid "The array is not copied: the wrapper and `xs` share storage, as with `@mutable.Vector::from_array`."
msgstr "数组不会被复制：包装对象与 `xs` 共享存储，这与 `@mutable.Vector::from_array` 相同。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:116
msgid "`DenseVector::from_backend(v)` wraps an existing `@mutable.Vector` without copying."
msgstr "`DenseVector::from_backend(v)` 包装一个已有的 `@mutable.Vector`，不进行复制。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:125
msgid "`DenseVector::make(n, x)` builds a vector of length `n` filled with `x`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::make(n, x)` 构建一个长度为 `n`、所有元素均为 `x` 的向量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:133
msgid "`DenseVector::inner(v)` returns the wrapped `@mutable.Vector`; writes to it are visible through the wrapper."
msgstr "`DenseVector::inner(v)` 返回被包装的 `@mutable.Vector`；对它的写入可以通过包装对象观察到。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:142
msgid "`DenseVector::length(v)` returns the number of elements."
msgstr "`DenseVector::length(v)` 返回元素个数。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:150
msgid "`DenseVector::at(v, i)` returns element `i`; it backs `v[i]`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::at(v, i)` 返回第 `i` 个元素；它是 `v[i]` 的底层实现。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:157
msgid "An index outside `0..<length` aborts."
msgstr "超出 `0..<length` 的索引会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:161
msgid "These are the promoted operator methods behind `u + v`, `u - v` and `-v`."
msgstr "这些是 `u + v`、`u - v` 和 `-v` 背后的提升运算符方法。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:169
msgid "Operands of different lengths abort. Subtraction is computed as $u + (-v)$."
msgstr "长度不同的操作数会导致中止。减法按 $u + (-v)$ 计算。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:173
msgid "`DenseVector::mul(u, v)` is the element-wise (Hadamard) product behind `u * v`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::mul(u, v)` 是 `u * v` 背后的按元素（Hadamard）乘积。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:181
msgid "`DenseVector::scale(v, a)` returns $(v_i \\cdot a)_i$, multiplying each element on the right by the scalar."
msgstr "`DenseVector::scale(v, a)` 返回 $(v_i \\cdot a)_i$，即每个元素右乘该标量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:190
msgid "`DenseVector::dot(u, v)` returns $\\sum_i u_i v_i$, summed left to right from `Zero::zero()`."
msgstr "`DenseVector::dot(u, v)` 返回 $\\sum_i u_i v_i$，从 `Zero::zero()` 开始自左向右求和。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:197
#: manual/api/backends/default.md:444
msgid "Vectors of different lengths abort."
msgstr "长度不同的向量会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:201
msgid "`DenseVector::axpy(x, a, y)` returns $x a + y$, the BLAS `axpy` combination with `self` as $x$."
msgstr "`DenseVector::axpy(x, a, y)` 返回 $x a + y$，即以 `self` 作为 $x$ 的 BLAS `axpy` 组合。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:208
msgid "The result is a new vector; `y` is not updated in place."
msgstr "结果是一个新向量；`y` 不会被原地更新。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:227
msgid "`DenseMatrix[T]` is the mutable dense matrix wrapper."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix[T]` 是可变稠密矩阵的包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:235
msgid "Implemented traits: `Add`, `Neg`, `Sub`, `Mul` (matrix product), `@algebra.MatrixShape` and `@algebra.TransposeMatrix` for all `T`, `@algebra.AdditiveMatrix` when `T : Add + Neg`, and `@algebra.MatMulMatrix` when `T : Add + Neg + AddMonoid + Mul`."
msgstr "已实现的 trait：对所有 `T` 实现的 `Add`、`Neg`、`Sub`、`Mul`（矩阵乘积）、`@algebra.MatrixShape` 和 `@algebra.TransposeMatrix`，当 `T : Add + Neg` 时的 `@algebra.AdditiveMatrix`，以及当 `T : Add + Neg + AddMonoid + Mul` 时的 `@algebra.MatMulMatrix`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:242
msgid "`DenseMatrix::from_2d_array(rows)` builds a matrix from nested row arrays."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::from_2d_array(rows)` 从按行组织的嵌套数组构造矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:248
msgid "Ragged input aborts; `[]` gives a $0 \\times 0$ matrix."
msgstr "参差不齐的输入会导致中止；`[]` 得到 $0 \\times 0$ 矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:252
msgid "`DenseMatrix::from_backend(m)` wraps an existing `@mutable.Matrix` without copying."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::from_backend(m)` 包装一个已有的 `@mutable.Matrix`，不进行复制。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:261
msgid "`DenseMatrix::new(r, c, x)` builds an $r \\times c$ matrix filled with `x`."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::new(r, c, x)` 构建一个所有元素均为 `x` 的 $r \\times c$ 矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:267
msgid "Negative dimensions abort."
msgstr "负的维度会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:271
msgid "`DenseMatrix::inner(m)` returns the wrapped `@mutable.Matrix`, which gives access to the full `@mutable` API (views, decompositions, checked methods)."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::inner(m)` 返回被包装的 `@mutable.Matrix`，借此可以使用完整的 `@mutable` API（视图、分解、受检方法）。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:280
#: manual/api/immut.md:202
msgid "`row` and `col` return the number of rows and columns."
msgstr "`row` 和 `col` 返回行数和列数。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:289
msgid "`DenseMatrix::shape(m)` returns `(rows, cols)`; it is the promoted `@algebra.MatrixShape::shape`."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::shape(m)` 返回 `(rows, cols)`；它是提升后的 `@algebra.MatrixShape::shape`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:298
msgid "`DenseMatrix::transpose(m)` returns a materialized transpose; it is the promoted `@algebra.TransposeMatrix::transpose`."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::transpose(m)` 返回实化后的转置；它是提升后的 `@algebra.TransposeMatrix::transpose`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:307
msgid "Entry-wise `+`, `-` and unary `-`."
msgstr "按元素的 `+`、`-` 和一元 `-`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:315
#: manual/api/immut.md:360
msgid "Operands of different shapes abort."
msgstr "形状不同的操作数会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:319
msgid "`DenseMatrix::mul(a, b)` is the matrix product behind `a * b`."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::mul(a, b)` 是 `a * b` 背后的矩阵乘积。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:325
msgid ""
"$\\operatorname{cols}(a) \\n"
"e \\operatorname{rows}(b)$ aborts with `Matrix::mul: dimension mismatch`. Cost: $rcn$ multiply-adds."
msgstr ""
"$\\operatorname{cols}(a) \\n"
"e \\operatorname{rows}(b)$ 时会以 `Matrix::mul: dimension mismatch` 中止。开销：$rcn$ 次乘加。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:330
msgid "`DenseMatrix::matvec(a, x)` returns the matrix-vector product $A x$ as a new `DenseVector`."
msgstr "`DenseMatrix::matvec(a, x)` 以新的 `DenseVector` 返回矩阵-向量乘积 $A x$。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:337
msgid "A length mismatch aborts; use `a.inner().mul_vec(x.inner())` for a checked version."
msgstr "长度不匹配会导致中止；如需受检版本，请使用 `a.inner().mul_vec(x.inner())`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:357
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector[T]` is the immutable dense vector wrapper."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector[T]` 是不可变稠密向量的包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:365
msgid "It implements the same traits as `DenseVector` under the same constraints."
msgstr "它在相同约束下实现与 `DenseVector` 相同的 trait。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:369
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::from_array(xs)` copies `xs` into a new `@immut.Vector`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::from_array(xs)` 将 `xs` 复制到一个新的 `@immut.Vector` 中。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:377
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::from_backend(v)` wraps an existing `@immut.Vector`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::from_backend(v)` 包装一个已有的 `@immut.Vector`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:385
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::make(n, x)` builds a vector of length `n` filled with `x`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::make(n, x)` 构建一个长度为 `n`、所有元素均为 `x` 的向量。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:394
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::inner(v)` returns the wrapped `@immut.Vector`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::inner(v)` 返回被包装的 `@immut.Vector`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:402
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::length(v)` returns the number of elements."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::length(v)` 返回元素个数。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:410
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::at(v, i)` returns element `i`; it backs `v[i]`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::at(v, i)` 返回第 `i` 个元素；它是 `v[i]` 的底层实现。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:419
msgid "Element-wise `+`, `-`, unary `-` and Hadamard `*`."
msgstr "按元素的 `+`、`-`、一元 `-` 和 Hadamard `*`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:430
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::scale(v, a)` returns $(v_i \\cdot a)_i$."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::scale(v, a)` 返回 $(v_i \\cdot a)_i$。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:438
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::dot(u, v)` returns $\\sum_i u_i v_i$."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::dot(u, v)` 返回 $\\sum_i u_i v_i$。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:448
msgid "`ImmutableDenseVector::axpy(x, a, y)` returns $x a + y$."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseVector::axpy(x, a, y)` 返回 $x a + y$。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:458
msgid "`ImmutableDenseMatrix[T]` is the immutable dense matrix wrapper."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseMatrix[T]` 是不可变稠密矩阵的包装类型。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:466
msgid "It implements the same traits as `DenseMatrix`; `@algebra.MatMulMatrix` needs `T : Add + Neg + Zero + Mul`."
msgstr "它实现与 `DenseMatrix` 相同的 trait；`@algebra.MatMulMatrix` 需要 `T : Add + Neg + Zero + Mul`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:471
msgid "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::from_2d_array(rows)` builds a matrix from nested rows; ragged input aborts."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::from_2d_array(rows)` 从嵌套的行数组构造矩阵；参差不齐的输入会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:480
msgid "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::from_backend(m)` wraps an existing `@immut.Matrix`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::from_backend(m)` 包装一个已有的 `@immut.Matrix`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:488
msgid "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::new(r, c, x)` builds an $r \\times c$ matrix filled with `x`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::new(r, c, x)` 构建一个所有元素均为 `x` 的 $r \\times c$ 矩阵。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:497
msgid "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::inner(m)` returns the wrapped `@immut.Matrix`."
msgstr "`ImmutableDenseMatrix::inner(m)` 返回被包装的 `@immut.Matrix`。"

#: manual/api/backends/default.md:505
