#: manual/api/container.md:1
msgid "container API"
msgstr "container API"

#: manual/api/container.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/container` describes how generic code observes, builds and edits linear containers without knowing their storage. A capability is an *operation dictionary*: a record of functions for one container type `V` or `M` and one element type `T`. Five generic algorithms (map, convert and transpose) are written against these dictionaries. Ready-made dictionaries for the repository's own types are in [`container/adapters`](container/adapters.md)."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/container` 描述泛型代码如何在不了解存储方式的情况下观察、构建和编辑线性容器。一项能力就是一个*操作字典*：针对某个容器类型 `V` 或 `M` 和某个元素类型 `T` 的函数记录。五个泛型算法（映射、转换和转置）就是基于这些字典编写的。仓库自身类型的现成字典位于 [`container/adapters`](container/adapters.md)。"

#: manual/api/container.md:12
msgid "Source: [`src/container/vector_ops.mbt`](../../../src/container/vector_ops.mbt), [`src/container/matrix_ops.mbt`](../../../src/container/matrix_ops.mbt), [`src/container/generic_algorithms.mbt`](../../../src/container/generic_algorithms.mbt). The model is explained in the [container design](../design/container.md); the [integration guide](../integration/container.md) shows how external libraries publish dictionaries."
msgstr "源码：[`src/container/vector_ops.mbt`](../../../src/container/vector_ops.mbt)、[`src/container/matrix_ops.mbt`](../../../src/container/matrix_ops.mbt)、[`src/container/generic_algorithms.mbt`](../../../src/container/generic_algorithms.mbt)。该模型见 [container 设计](../design/container.md)；[集成指南](../integration/container.md)展示了外部库如何发布字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:19
msgid "[!WARNING] `container` is experimental. Record fields, error contracts and algorithm signatures may change incompatibly before the package is declared stable."
msgstr "[!WARNING] `container` 仍处于实验阶段。在该包被宣布为稳定之前，记录字段、错误约定和算法签名都可能发生不兼容的变化。"

#: manual/api/container.md:34
msgid "The examples on this page write every name with its package prefix, such as `@container.`, instead of a `using` declaration: all pages of this manual compile into one test package, where the declarations of different pages would clash."
msgstr "本页示例中的每个名称都带上包前缀（如 `@container.`），而不使用 `using` 声明：本手册的所有页面会编译进同一个测试包，不同页面的声明会相互冲突。"

#: manual/api/container.md:39
msgid "Contracts shared by all dictionaries"
msgstr "所有字典共享的约定"

#: manual/api/container.md:41
msgid "Every function in a dictionary is checked: it returns a `Result` and must not abort for any argument."
msgstr "字典中的每个函数都是受检的：它返回 `Result`，并且对任何参数都不得中止。"

#: manual/api/container.md:44
msgid "A read or edit at an index outside the shape returns an error of kind `IndexOutOfBounds`."
msgstr "在形状范围之外的索引处读取或编辑，会返回 kind 为 `IndexOutOfBounds` 的错误。"

#: manual/api/container.md:46
msgid "A build with a negative length or dimension returns an error of kind `NegativeDimension` and does not call the initializer."
msgstr "以负长度或负维度进行构建，会返回 kind 为 `NegativeDimension` 的错误，并且不会调用初始化函数。"

#: manual/api/container.md:48
msgid "Degenerate shapes $0 \\times n$ and $n \\times 0$ are valid and must be preserved exactly; they are not the same as $0 \\times 0$."
msgstr "退化形状 $0 \\times n$ 和 $n \\times 0$ 是合法的，必须被精确保留；它们与 $0 \\times 0$ 不同。"

#: manual/api/container.md:50
msgid "Matrix coordinates are `(row, col)`, zero-based. Builders call the initializer with `(row, col)`."
msgstr "矩阵坐标为 `(row, col)`，从零开始。构建函数以 `(row, col)` 调用初始化函数。"

#: manual/api/container.md:53
msgid "The record fields are public and readable. Call a field as a function with parentheses around the field access: `(ops.get)(m, 0, 1)`."
msgstr "记录字段是公开且可读的。将字段作为函数调用时，需要用括号包住字段访问：`(ops.get)(m, 0, 1)`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:56
msgid "Vector dictionaries"
msgstr "向量字典"

#: manual/api/container.md:60
msgid "`VectorReadOps[V, T]` observes a vector-like container `V` with elements `T`."
msgstr "`VectorReadOps[V, T]` 用于观察元素类型为 `T` 的类向量容器 `V`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:69
msgid "`length(v)` returns the number of elements $n \\ge 0$; `get(v, i)` returns element $i$ for $0 \\le i < n$ and `IndexOutOfBounds` otherwise."
msgstr "`length(v)` 返回元素个数 $n \\ge 0$；`get(v, i)` 在 $0 \\le i < n$ 时返回第 $i$ 个元素，否则返回 `IndexOutOfBounds`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:74
msgid "`VectorReadOps::new(length, get)` builds a read dictionary from two functions."
msgstr "`VectorReadOps::new(length, get)` 由两个函数构建读取字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:82
msgid "`VectorBuildOps[V, T]` constructs vectors of type `V` from an index function."
msgstr "`VectorBuildOps[V, T]` 由索引函数构造类型为 `V` 的向量。"

#: manual/api/container.md:90
msgid "`tabulate(n, f)` returns the vector $(f(0), \\dots, f(n-1))$, or `NegativeDimension` for $n < 0$."
msgstr "`tabulate(n, f)` 返回向量 $(f(0), \\dots, f(n-1))$，当 $n < 0$ 时返回 `NegativeDimension`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:95
msgid "`VectorBuildOps::new(tabulate)` builds a build dictionary."
msgstr "`VectorBuildOps::new(tabulate)` 构建一个构建字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:103
msgid "`VectorPersistentEditOps[V, T]` replaces one element and returns a new value."
msgstr "`VectorPersistentEditOps[V, T]` 替换一个元素并返回新值。"

#: manual/api/container.md:111
msgid "`set(v, i, x)` returns a vector equal to `v` except at index $i$, where it holds `x`. The argument `v` must remain unchanged, even if the implementation shares storage between versions."
msgstr "`set(v, i, x)` 返回一个除索引 $i$ 处为 `x` 外其余都与 `v` 相等的向量。即使实现在不同版本之间共享存储，参数 `v` 也必须保持不变。"

#: manual/api/container.md:117
msgid "`VectorPersistentEditOps::new(set)` builds a persistent-edit dictionary."
msgstr "`VectorPersistentEditOps::new(set)` 构建一个持久化编辑字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:125
msgid "`VectorMutableEditOps[V, T]` replaces one element in place."
msgstr "`VectorMutableEditOps[V, T]` 原地替换一个元素。"

#: manual/api/container.md:133
msgid "`set(v, i, x)` writes `x` at index $i$ of `v`. On error nothing is written."
msgstr "`set(v, i, x)` 将 `x` 写入 `v` 的索引 $i$ 处。出错时不会写入任何内容。"

#: manual/api/container.md:137
msgid "`VectorMutableEditOps::new(set)` builds a mutable-edit dictionary."
msgstr "`VectorMutableEditOps::new(set)` 构建一个可变编辑字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:143
msgid "Matrix dictionaries"
msgstr "矩阵字典"

#: manual/api/container.md:147
msgid "`MatrixReadOps[M, T]` observes a matrix-like container."
msgstr "`MatrixReadOps[M, T]` 用于观察类矩阵容器。"

#: manual/api/container.md:156
msgid "`shape(m)` returns `(rows, cols)`; `get(m, r, c)` returns entry $(r, c)$ or `IndexOutOfBounds`."
msgstr "`shape(m)` 返回 `(rows, cols)`；`get(m, r, c)` 返回元素 $(r, c)$ 或 `IndexOutOfBounds`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:161
msgid "`MatrixReadOps::new(shape, get)` builds a matrix read dictionary."
msgstr "`MatrixReadOps::new(shape, get)` 构建一个矩阵读取字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:169
msgid "`MatrixBuildOps[M, T]` constructs matrices from a coordinate function."
msgstr "`MatrixBuildOps[M, T]` 由坐标函数构造矩阵。"

#: manual/api/container.md:177
msgid "`tabulate(r, c, f)` returns the matrix with entries $f(i, j)$, or `NegativeDimension` when $r < 0$ or $c < 0$."
msgstr "`tabulate(r, c, f)` 返回元素为 $f(i, j)$ 的矩阵，当 $r < 0$ 或 $c < 0$ 时返回 `NegativeDimension`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:182
msgid "`MatrixBuildOps::new(tabulate)` builds a matrix build dictionary."
msgstr "`MatrixBuildOps::new(tabulate)` 构建一个矩阵构建字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:190
msgid "`MatrixPersistentEditOps[M, T]` replaces one entry and returns a new matrix, leaving the argument unchanged."
msgstr "`MatrixPersistentEditOps[M, T]` 替换一个元素并返回新矩阵，参数保持不变。"

#: manual/api/container.md:201
msgid "`MatrixPersistentEditOps::new(set)` builds a persistent-edit dictionary."
msgstr "`MatrixPersistentEditOps::new(set)` 构建一个持久化编辑字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:209
msgid "`MatrixMutableEditOps[M, T]` replaces one entry in place."
msgstr "`MatrixMutableEditOps[M, T]` 原地替换一个元素。"

#: manual/api/container.md:219
msgid "`MatrixMutableEditOps::new(set)` builds a mutable-edit dictionary."
msgstr "`MatrixMutableEditOps::new(set)` 构建一个可变编辑字典。"

#: manual/api/container.md:225
msgid "A dictionary for a plain `Array[Int]`, used through its fields:"
msgstr "为普通 `Array[Int]` 定义的字典，通过其字段使用："

#: manual/api/container.md:252
msgid "Generic algorithms"
msgstr "泛型算法"

#: manual/api/container.md:254
msgid "All algorithms read the whole source first, in row-major order, into a temporary buffer, and only then call the target's `tabulate`. A read error is returned before anything is built, so no partially built target is ever observable. Each runs in $O(n)$ dictionary calls for $n$ elements and uses $O(n)$ extra memory."
msgstr "所有算法都先按行主序将整个源读入临时缓冲区，然后才调用目标的 `tabulate`。读取错误会在构建任何内容之前返回，因此永远不会观察到部分构建的目标。对于 $n$ 个元素，每个算法执行 $O(n)$ 次字典调用，并使用 $O(n)$ 的额外内存。"

#: manual/api/container.md:262
msgid "`vector_map(source, source_ops, target_ops, f)` builds a vector of the target type whose element $i$ is `f(source[i])`."
msgstr "`vector_map(source, source_ops, target_ops, f)` 构建一个目标类型的向量，其第 $i$ 个元素为 `f(source[i])`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:269
msgid "It returns `NegativeDimension` if `source_ops.length` reports a negative length, the first read error otherwise, and finally whatever `tabulate` returns. `f` is called exactly once per element, in index order, right after that element is read; if a read fails, `f` has already been called on the elements before it."
msgstr "如果 `source_ops.length` 报告负长度，它返回 `NegativeDimension`；否则返回第一个读取错误；最后返回 `tabulate` 的结果。`f` 按索引顺序对每个元素恰好调用一次，紧接在该元素被读取之后；若某次读取失败，此前的元素已经调用过 `f`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:277
msgid "`vector_convert(source, source_ops, target_ops)` copies a vector into another representation with the same element type."
msgstr "`vector_convert(source, source_ops, target_ops)` 将向量复制到元素类型相同的另一种表示中。"

#: manual/api/container.md:284
msgid "It is `vector_map` with the identity function."
msgstr "它就是以恒等函数调用的 `vector_map`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:288
msgid "`matrix_map(source, source_ops, target_ops, f)` builds a matrix of the same shape whose entry $(i, j)$ is `f(source[i][j])`."
msgstr "`matrix_map(source, source_ops, target_ops, f)` 构建一个形状相同的矩阵，其元素 $(i, j)$ 为 `f(source[i][j])`。"

#: manual/api/container.md:297
msgid "`matrix_convert(source, source_ops, target_ops)` copies a matrix into another representation with the same element type and shape."
msgstr "`matrix_convert(source, source_ops, target_ops)` 将矩阵复制到元素类型和形状都相同的另一种表示中。"

#: manual/api/container.md:306
msgid "`matrix_transpose(source, source_ops, target_ops)` builds the transpose of `source` in the target representation: shape $(c, r)$ for a source of shape $(r, c)$, entry $(i, j)$ equal to source entry $(j, i)$."
msgstr "`matrix_transpose(source, source_ops, target_ops)` 在目标表示中构建 `source` 的转置：对于形状为 $(r, c)$ 的源，结果形状为 $(c, r)$，元素 $(i, j)$ 等于源中的元素 $(j, i)$。"

#: manual/api/container.md:314
msgid "Unlike `@algebra.TransposeMatrix::transpose`, the target type may differ from the source type."
msgstr "与 `@algebra.TransposeMatrix::transpose` 不同，目标类型可以与源类型不同。"

#: manual/api/container.md:317
msgid "The three matrix algorithms with the repository adapters:"
msgstr "结合仓库适配器使用三个矩阵算法："

#: manual/api/container.md:353
msgid "The vector algorithms work the same way:"
msgstr "向量算法的用法与之相同："

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:1
msgid "container/adapters API"
msgstr "container/adapters API"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/container/adapters` provides ready-made [`container`](../container.md) operation dictionaries for every vector and matrix type of this repository: the `@immut` and `@mutable` types, the mutable row, column and transpose views, and the four `backends/default` wrappers. Each factory is a generic function that returns a fresh dictionary; it has no state."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/container/adapters` 为本仓库的每种向量和矩阵类型提供现成的 [`container`](../container.md) 操作字典：包括 `@immut` 和 `@mutable` 类型、可变的行视图、列视图和转置视图，以及四个 `backends/default` 包装类型。每个工厂都是返回全新字典的泛型函数，本身不带状态。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:11
msgid "Source: [`src/container/adapters`](../../../../src/container/adapters/vector_adapters.mbt). Why the adapters live in a package of their own is explained in the [adapters design](../../design/container/adapters.md)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/container/adapters`](../../../../src/container/adapters/vector_adapters.mbt)。适配器为何单独成包见 [adapters 设计](../../design/container/adapters.md)。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:15
msgid "[!WARNING] Like `container`, this package is experimental."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 与 `container` 一样，该包仍处于实验阶段。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:28
msgid "The examples on this page write every name with its package prefix, such as `@container_adapters.`, instead of a `using` declaration: all pages of this manual compile into one test package, where the declarations of different pages would clash."
msgstr "本页示例中的每个名称都带上包前缀（如 `@container_adapters.`），而不使用 `using` 声明：本手册的所有页面会编译进同一个测试包，不同页面的声明会相互冲突。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:33
msgid "Capability matrix"
msgstr "能力矩阵"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:35
msgid "read"
msgstr "读取"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:35
