#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:38
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:39
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:40
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:41
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:42
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:43
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:44
