#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:46
msgid "Every dictionary follows the shared contract of the `container` API: reads and edits check indices first and return `IndexOutOfBounds` without touching storage; builders return `NegativeDimension` for a negative shape without calling the initializer. No factory places a constraint on `T`."
msgstr "每个字典都遵循 `container` API 的共享约定：读取和编辑会先检查索引，并在不触及存储的情况下返回 `IndexOutOfBounds`；构建函数在形状为负时返回 `NegativeDimension`，且不会调用初始化函数。所有工厂都不对 `T` 施加约束。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:55
msgid "`immutable_vector_read_ops` returns the read dictionary for `@immut.Vector`."
msgstr "`immutable_vector_read_ops` 返回 `@immut.Vector` 的读取字典。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:61
#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:125
msgid "`get` reads `v[i]` after a bounds check."
msgstr "`get` 在边界检查后读取 `v[i]`。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:65
msgid "`immutable_vector_build_ops` returns the build dictionary for `@immut.Vector`."
msgstr "`immutable_vector_build_ops` 返回 `@immut.Vector` 的构建字典。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:71
msgid "`tabulate(n, f)` is `@immut.Vector::makei(n, f)`."
msgstr "`tabulate(n, f)` 即 `@immut.Vector::makei(n, f)`。"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:75
