#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:373
#: manual/api/internal.md:116
#: manual/api/perf_support.md:175
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: manual/api/container/adapters.md:375
msgid "One source, three targets, and a checked edit through a view:"
msgstr "一个源、三个目标，以及一次通过视图进行的受检编辑："

#: manual/api/error.md:1
msgid "error API"
msgstr "error API"

#: manual/api/error.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/error` defines `LinearAlgebraError`, the error value returned by every checked API of this repository, and its classification `LinearAlgebraErrorKind`. A caller branches on the kind (or on an `is_*` predicate) and uses the message only for diagnostics."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/linear-algebra/error` 定义了 `LinearAlgebraError`（本仓库每个受检 API 返回的错误值）及其分类 `LinearAlgebraErrorKind`。调用者根据 kind（或某个 `is_*` 判断方法）进行分支，消息仅用于诊断。"

#: manual/api/error.md:10
msgid "Source: [`src/error/error.mbt`](../../../src/error/error.mbt). Why checked APIs return this value is explained in the [error design](../design/error.md)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/error/error.mbt`](../../../src/error/error.mbt)。受检 API 为何返回该值见 [error 设计](../design/error.md)。"

#: manual/api/error.md:22
msgid "The examples on this page write every name with its package prefix, such as `@la_error.`, instead of a `using` declaration: all pages of this manual compile into one test package, where the declarations of different pages would clash. The alias `@la_error` avoids a clash with MoonBit's builtin `Error` vocabulary."
msgstr "本页示例中的每个名称都带上包前缀（如 `@la_error.`），而不使用 `using` 声明：本手册的所有页面会编译进同一个测试包，不同页面的声明会相互冲突。别名 `@la_error` 避免了与 MoonBit 内置 `Error` 词汇的冲突。"

#: manual/api/error.md:28
#: manual/api/immut.md:48
#: manual/api/mutable.md:58
#: manual/api/perf_support.md:34
msgid "Types"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/error.md:32
msgid "`LinearAlgebraErrorKind` classifies a failure."
msgstr "`LinearAlgebraErrorKind` 对失败进行分类。"

#: manual/api/error.md:50
msgid "The enum is `pub`: other packages can read and `match` its values but cannot construct them, not even for a comparison such as `kind == SingularMatrix`. Build errors with the constructors of `LinearAlgebraError` below and test kinds with `match` or the `is_*` predicates."
msgstr "该枚举是 `pub` 的：其他包可以读取并 `match` 它的值，但不能构造它们，即便是用于 `kind == SingularMatrix` 这样的比较也不行。请使用下文 `LinearAlgebraError` 的构造函数创建错误，并用 `match` 或 `is_*` 判断方法检查 kind。"

#: manual/api/error.md:55
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "种类"

#: manual/api/error.md:55
msgid "Produced by"
msgstr "产生方"

#: manual/api/error.md:57
msgid "operand shapes are incompatible"
msgstr "操作数形状不兼容"

#: manual/api/error.md:58
msgid "a row, column or element index is outside the shape"
msgstr "行、列或元素索引超出形状范围"

#: manual/api/error.md:58
msgid "`container` adapters"
msgstr "`container` 适配器"

#: manual/api/error.md:59
msgid "a requested shape or length is negative"
msgstr "请求的形状或长度为负"

#: manual/api/error.md:59
msgid "`container` builders and algorithms"
msgstr "`container` 构建函数与算法"

#: manual/api/error.md:60
msgid "a flat buffer has the wrong length"
msgstr "扁平缓冲区长度错误"

#: manual/api/error.md:60
#: manual/api/error.md:61
#: manual/api/error.md:66
msgid "reserved; not produced in this release"
msgstr "保留；本版本不会产生"

#: manual/api/error.md:61
msgid "nested rows have different lengths"
msgstr "嵌套的各行长度不同"

#: manual/api/error.md:62
msgid "the operation needs a square matrix"
msgstr "该运算需要方阵"

#: manual/api/error.md:63
msgid "a matrix power has a negative exponent"
msgstr "矩阵幂的指数为负"

#: manual/api/error.md:64
msgid "the operation needs at least one element"
msgstr "该运算至少需要一个元素"

#: manual/api/error.md:65
msgid "the matrix is singular within tolerance"
msgstr "矩阵在容差范围内奇异"

#: manual/api/error.md:66
msgid "an iteration did not converge"
msgstr "迭代未收敛"

#: manual/api/error.md:67
msgid "a scalar operation failed with `e`"
msgstr "标量运算以 `e` 失败"

#: manual/api/error.md:67
msgid "reserved for callers; not produced in this release"
msgstr "保留给调用者使用；本版本不会产生"

#: manual/api/error.md:71
msgid "`LinearAlgebraErrorKind::equal` compares two kinds structurally; it backs `==`."
msgstr "`LinearAlgebraErrorKind::equal` 按结构比较两个 kind；它是 `==` 的底层实现。"

#: manual/api/error.md:77
msgid "Two `ArithmeticFailure` kinds are equal when their wrapped `ArithmeticError` values are equal."
msgstr "当两个 `ArithmeticFailure` kind 所包装的 `ArithmeticError` 值相等时，它们相等。"

#: manual/api/error.md:82
msgid "`LinearAlgebraError` pairs a machine-readable kind with a human-readable message."
msgstr "`LinearAlgebraError` 将适合程序判断的 kind 与适合人阅读的消息组合在一起。"

#: manual/api/error.md:92
msgid "Both fields are readable from other packages. The type implements `Eq` but neither `Show` nor `Debug`, so print `err.message` rather than the error itself, and compare errors with `==` or a predicate rather than `inspect`."
msgstr "两个字段都可从其他包读取。该类型实现了 `Eq`，但没有实现 `Show` 和 `Debug`，因此请打印 `err.message` 而不是错误本身，并用 `==` 或判断方法而不是 `inspect` 来比较错误。"

#: manual/api/error.md:98
msgid "`LinearAlgebraError::equal` compares kind and message; it backs `==`."
msgstr "`LinearAlgebraError::equal` 比较 kind 和消息；它是 `==` 的底层实现。"

#: manual/api/error.md:104
msgid "Two errors of the same kind with different messages are not equal. Compare kinds (`a.kind == b.kind`) when the message does not matter."
msgstr "kind 相同但消息不同的两个错误并不相等。消息无关紧要时，请比较 kind（`a.kind == b.kind`）。"

#: manual/api/error.md:107
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "构造函数"

#: manual/api/error.md:109
msgid "Each constructor builds an error of one kind with the given message. Library code in this repository uses them; your own checked helpers can use them too."
msgstr "每个构造函数都用给定消息构建一种 kind 的错误。本仓库的库代码使用它们；你自己的受检辅助函数也可以使用。"

