msgstr "`is_empty_matrix` 检查是否为 `EmptyMatrix`。"

#: manual/api/error.md:300
msgid "`is_singular_matrix` tests for `SingularMatrix`."
msgstr "`is_singular_matrix` 检查是否为 `SingularMatrix`。"

#: manual/api/error.md:308
msgid "`is_non_convergence` tests for `NonConvergence`."
msgstr "`is_non_convergence` 检查是否为 `NonConvergence`。"

#: manual/api/error.md:316
msgid "`is_arithmetic_failure` tests for `ArithmeticFailure(_)`, whatever the wrapped error."
msgstr "`is_arithmetic_failure` 检查是否为 `ArithmeticFailure(_)`，无论其包装的是什么错误。"

#: manual/api/error.md:323
msgid "The predicates in use, on errors returned by real checked calls:"
msgstr "在真实受检调用返回的错误上使用这些判断方法："

#: manual/api/error.md:346
#: manual/api/immut.md:977
