#: manual/design/perf_runner.md:3
#: manual/design/perf_support.md:3
msgid "Design goal"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:5
msgid "`algebra` gives generic linear-algebra code a vocabulary for whole vector and matrix objects that is honest about what each object can do. A trait may only be implemented by a type that satisfies its laws, and an algorithm should be able to ask for exactly the structure it uses: a shape, an abelian group, a Hadamard ring, a transpose, or a matrix product. The package therefore defines small traits ordered by inclusion instead of one `Matrix` or `VectorSpace` trait. The [API page](../api/algebra.md) lists the traits; this page explains the mathematics they encode and the choices that follow from it."
msgstr "`algebra` 为泛型线性代数代码提供一套描述整体向量和矩阵对象的词汇，并如实反映每个对象能做什么。只有满足其定律的类型才可以实现某个 trait，而算法应当能够只要求它真正用到的结构：形状、阿贝尔群、Hadamard 环、转置或矩阵乘积。因此，该包定义的是一组按包含关系排序的小 trait，而不是单个 `Matrix` 或 `VectorSpace` trait。[API 页面](../api/algebra.md)列出了这些 trait；本页解释它们所编码的数学以及由此得出的设计选择。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:14
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:12
#: manual/design/backends/default.md:12
#: manual/design/consistency.md:12
#: manual/design/container.md:12
#: manual/design/container/adapters.md:11
#: manual/design/error.md:12
#: manual/design/immut.md:12
#: manual/design/internal.md:10
#: manual/design/mutable.md:14
#: manual/design/perf.md:9
#: manual/design/perf_runner.md:10
#: manual/design/perf_support.md:11
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:16
msgid "MoonBit traits have one `Self` parameter and no associated types, so a trait cannot name the scalar type of a vector or matrix."
msgstr "MoonBit 的 trait 只有一个 `Self` 参数，也没有关联类型，因此 trait 无法指名向量或矩阵的标量类型。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:18
msgid "MoonBit has no type-level naturals, so dimensions are runtime values and shape mismatches cannot be rejected by the type checker."
msgstr "MoonBit 没有类型层面的自然数，因此维度是运行时的值，形状不匹配无法由类型检查器拒绝。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:20
msgid "The package must not import any concrete type, so that external libraries can implement the traits without depending on `immut` or `mutable`."
msgstr "本包不得导入任何具体类型，这样外部库无需依赖 `immut` 或 `mutable` 就能实现这些 trait。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:22
msgid "The traits must reuse MoonBit's operator traits (`Add`, `Neg`, `Sub`, `Mul`) so that implementations keep their `+`, `-` and `*` syntax."
msgstr "这些 trait 必须复用 MoonBit 的运算符 trait（`Add`、`Neg`、`Sub`、`Mul`），使实现保留 `+`、`-` 和 `*` 语法。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:25
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:22
#: manual/design/backends/default.md:20
#: manual/design/consistency.md:19
#: manual/design/container.md:21
#: manual/design/container/adapters.md:19
#: manual/design/error.md:21
#: manual/design/immut.md:25
#: manual/design/internal.md:17
#: manual/design/mutable.md:26
#: manual/design/perf.md:14
#: manual/design/perf_runner.md:16
#: manual/design/perf_support.md:20
msgid "Design decisions"
msgstr "设计决策"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:27
msgid "Abelian group instead of module"
msgstr "用阿贝尔群代替模"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:29
msgid "**Problem.** The natural trait for \"a vector\" is an $R$-module, but a module has two carriers: the vectors and the scalars."
msgstr "**问题。** 表示“向量”最自然的 trait 是 $R$-模，但模有两个载体：向量和标量。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:32
msgid "**Options.** (a) A `Module` trait whose scalar type is fixed, for example `Double`. (b) A trait with an associated scalar type. (c) Only the additive structure, leaving scalars to concrete methods."
msgstr "**选项。** (a) 一个标量类型固定（例如 `Double`）的 `Module` trait。(b) 一个带关联标量类型的 trait。(c) 只描述加法结构，把标量留给具体方法。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:36
msgid "**Decision.** (c): `AdditiveVector` and `AdditiveMatrix` state the abelian group $(V, +, -)$ and nothing about scalars."
msgstr "**决定。** (c)：`AdditiveVector` 和 `AdditiveMatrix` 只陈述阿贝尔群 $(V, +, -)$，不涉及标量。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:39
msgid "**Why.** MoonBit traits have a single `Self` parameter and no associated types, so option (b) cannot be expressed. Option (a) would make every module over `Int`, `BigInt` or a user scalar type unrepresentable, and would hard-code one floating-point type into a public trait. Scalar multiplication therefore stays a method of the concrete types (`scale`, `left_scale`, `right_scale`) where the scalar type is known."
msgstr "**理由。** MoonBit 的 trait 只有一个 `Self` 参数，没有关联类型，因此无法表达选项 (b)。选项 (a) 会使 `Int`、`BigInt` 或用户标量类型上的模都无法表示，并把某一种浮点类型硬编码进公开 trait。因此，标量乘法仍是具体类型的方法（`scale`、`left_scale`、`right_scale`），在那里标量类型是已知的。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:46
msgid "No zero in the vector traits"
msgstr "向量 trait 中没有零元"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:48
msgid "A runtime-shaped vector type has no single zero: the identity of $(R^n, +)$ depends on $n$. A trait method `zero() -> Self` would have to choose a length. The traits therefore ask for `Add`, `Neg` and `Sub` only, and the group laws are stated without a named zero:"
msgstr "运行时确定形状的向量类型没有唯一的零元：$(R^n, +)$ 的单位元取决于 $n$。trait 方法 `zero() -> Self` 不得不选定一个长度。因此这些 trait 只要求 `Add`、`Neg` 和 `Sub`，群定律的陈述也不借助具名的零元："

#: manual/design/algebra.md:57
msgid "The element $u + (-u)$ is the zero of the right length. The upstream `Zero` trait from `luna-generic` remains available for scalar types, where a single zero exists."
msgstr "元素 $u + (-u)$ 就是长度正确的零元。对于标量类型，来自 `luna-generic` 的上游 `Zero` trait 仍然可用，因为那里存在唯一的零元。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:61
msgid "Hadamard product as its own level"
msgstr "Hadamard 积单独成为一层"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:63
msgid "`Mul` on a vector type could mean the Hadamard product, a dot product, or a cross product, and only the first is closed ($R^n \\times R^n \\to R^n$ for all $n$). `VecMulVector` fixes the meaning to the Hadamard product and lives above `AdditiveVector`, so an algorithm that only adds vectors does not exclude types without a product. Scalar-valued products such as the dot product are maps $R^n \\times R^n \\to R$ out of the category of vectors; they are methods of the concrete backends (`DenseVector::dot`), not structure traits."
msgstr "向量类型上的 `Mul` 可能表示 Hadamard 积、点积或叉积，而只有第一种是封闭的（对所有 $n$ 有 $R^n \\times R^n \\to R^n$）。`VecMulVector` 把含义固定为 Hadamard 积，并位于 `AdditiveVector` 之上，因此只做向量加法的算法不会排除没有乘积的类型。点积这类取标量值的乘积是映射 $R^n \\times R^n \\to R$，超出了向量范畴；它们是具体后端的方法（`DenseVector::dot`），而不是结构 trait。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:71
msgid "Matrix multiplication is partial and documented, not typed"
msgstr "矩阵乘法是部分运算，以文档说明而非类型编码"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:73
msgid "**Problem.** On a runtime-shaped matrix type, `*` is defined only for composable shapes. A trait method returning `Self` cannot report failure."
msgstr "**问题。** 在运行时确定形状的矩阵类型上，`*` 只对可复合的形状有定义。返回 `Self` 的 trait 方法无法报告失败。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:76
msgid "**Options.** (a) Put `Mul` into the smallest matrix trait. (b) Encode shapes in types. (c) Separate shape, transpose and addition from multiplication, and let each implementation document the behaviour outside the domain."
msgstr "**选项。** (a) 把 `Mul` 放进最小的矩阵 trait。(b) 在类型中编码形状。(c) 把形状、转置和加法与乘法分开，由各实现自行说明定义域之外的行为。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:80
msgid "**Decision.** (c). `TransposeMatrix` and `AdditiveMatrix` are useful without multiplication, and `MatMulMatrix` is a separate level whose implementors must document their failure behaviour. A type with statically known shapes, such as a fixed $1 \\times 1$ or $3 \\times 3$ matrix, implements `MatMulMatrix` with a total `*`."
msgstr "**决定。** (c)。`TransposeMatrix` 和 `AdditiveMatrix` 不需要乘法也有用，`MatMulMatrix` 是单独的一层，其实现者必须说明失败行为。形状在静态时已知的类型（例如固定的 $1 \\times 1$ 或 $3 \\times 3$ 矩阵）可以用全函数 `*` 实现 `MatMulMatrix`。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:86
msgid "**Why.** MoonBit has no type-level naturals, so (b) is not available for dynamic dimensions. Option (a) would force a partial operation onto every matrix type, including ones that never multiply. Checked multiplication with a `Result` remains available on the concrete types (`@immut.Matrix::matmul`), where the error type is fixed."
msgstr "**理由。** MoonBit 没有类型层面的自然数，因此对动态维度无法采用 (b)。选项 (a) 会把一个部分运算强加给每个矩阵类型，包括从不做乘法的类型。返回 `Result` 的受检乘法仍可在具体类型上使用（`@immut.Matrix::matmul`），在那里错误类型是固定的。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:92
msgid "Transpose returns `Self`"
msgstr "转置返回 `Self`"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:94
msgid "`TransposeMatrix::transpose` returns the same type. Transpose is total on every shape, so it is a closed operation and fits a trait method. Whether the result is materialized or a view is not part of the contract; the [`container`](container.md) layer, by contrast, has a transpose that may produce a different target type."
msgstr "`TransposeMatrix::transpose` 返回同一类型。转置对每种形状都是全函数，因此是封闭运算，适合作为 trait 方法。结果是物化的还是视图不属于契约的一部分；相比之下，[`container`](container.md) 层的转置可以产生不同的目标类型。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:100
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:55
#: manual/design/backends/default.md:60
#: manual/design/consistency.md:34
#: manual/design/container.md:75
#: manual/design/container/adapters.md:58
#: manual/design/error.md:66
#: manual/design/immut.md:79
#: manual/design/internal.md:39
#: manual/design/mutable.md:126
#: manual/design/perf.md:31
#: manual/design/perf_runner.md:35
#: manual/design/perf_support.md:49
msgid "Mathematical background"
msgstr "数学背景"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:102
msgid "Modules and vector spaces"
msgstr "模与向量空间"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:104
msgid "Let $R$ be a ring with unit. A (left) $R$-module is an abelian group $(V, +, 0, -)$ together with a scalar action $R \\times V \\to V$, $(r, v) \\mapsto r v$, such that for all $r, s \\in R$ and $u, v \\in V$"
msgstr "设 $R$ 是含幺环。一个（左）$R$-模是阿贝尔群 $(V, +, 0, -)$ 连同一个标量作用 $R \\times V \\to V$，$(r, v) \\mapsto r v$，使得对所有 $r, s \\in R$ 和 $u, v \\in V$ 有"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:115
msgid "A vector space is a module over a field. Most of linear algebra is stated for vector spaces, but most of the *code* only needs much less: matrix addition needs the abelian group, matrix multiplication needs a semiring of scalars, and only elimination needs division. Integer matrices, for example, form a $\\mathbb{Z}$-module and are not a vector space; requiring a field would exclude them from algorithms that never divide."
msgstr "向量空间是域上的模。线性代数的大部分内容是针对向量空间表述的，但大部分*代码*需要的要少得多：矩阵加法只需要阿贝尔群，矩阵乘法需要标量构成半环，只有消元才需要除法。例如，整数矩阵构成 $\\mathbb{Z}$-模，而不是向量空间；要求域会把它们排除在从不做除法的算法之外。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:122
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:124
msgid "A dense vector of length $n$ over $R$ is an element of $R^n$, a dense $m \\times n$ matrix an element of $R^{m \\times n}$. Entry-wise addition makes both abelian groups; the scalar action $r \\cdot (a_{ij}) = (r a_{ij})$ makes them $R$-modules. For fixed $n$, the entry-wise product"
msgstr "$R$ 上长度为 $n$ 的稠密向量是 $R^n$ 的元素，稠密 $m \\times n$ 矩阵是 $R^{m \\times n}$ 的元素。逐元素加法使二者都成为阿贝尔群；标量作用 $r \\cdot (a_{ij}) = (r a_{ij})$ 使它们成为 $R$-模。对固定的 $n$，逐元素乘积"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:133
msgid "makes $R^n$ a ring as well (the product ring), with unit $(1, \\dots, 1)$."
msgstr "也使 $R^n$ 成为一个环（积环），其单位元为 $(1, \\dots, 1)$。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:135
msgid "Matrices as a category"
msgstr "矩阵构成范畴"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:137
msgid "Matrix multiplication is not an operation on one set. Its shape rule"
msgstr "矩阵乘法并不是单个集合上的运算。它的形状规则"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:143
msgid "says that matrices are the morphisms of a category $\\mathbf{Mat}_R$ whose objects are the natural numbers: an $m \\times n$ matrix is an arrow $n \\to m$, multiplication is composition, and the identity matrix $I_n$ is the identity arrow on $n$. A product $AB$ is defined exactly when the arrows are composable. Over a fixed object $n$ the arrows $n \\to n$ (the square matrices) form a ring, the familiar $M_n(R)$."
msgstr "表明矩阵是范畴 $\\mathbf{Mat}_R$ 的态射，该范畴的对象是自然数：$m \\times n$ 矩阵是箭头 $n \\to m$，乘法是复合，单位矩阵 $I_n$ 是 $n$ 上的恒等箭头。乘积 $AB$ 恰在两个箭头可复合时有定义。在固定对象 $n$ 上，箭头 $n \\to n$（即方阵）构成一个环，也就是熟知的 $M_n(R)$。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:150
msgid "Associativity of composition holds whenever $R$ is a semiring. For $A \\in R^{m \\times n}$, $B \\in R^{n \\times p}$, $C \\in R^{p \\times q}$:"
msgstr "只要 $R$ 是半环，复合的结合律就成立。对 $A \\in R^{m \\times n}$、$B \\in R^{n \\times p}$、$C \\in R^{p \\times q}$："

#: manual/design/algebra.md:168
msgid "Commutativity of multiplication was never used, so the law holds for matrices over any semiring, including non-commutative ones such as quaternions. The derivation also covers empty inner dimensions: when $n = 0$ or $p = 0$ an inner sum is the empty sum $0$, and right distributivity over the empty sum is the absorption law $0 \\cdot c = 0$ (and left distributivity gives $a \\cdot 0 = 0$), which every semiring has.[^absorb] The same computation with $C = I$ shows $AI = A$, and distributivity of the product over matrix addition follows entry-wise from distributivity in $R$."
msgstr "推导中从未用到乘法交换律，因此该定律对任意半环上的矩阵都成立，包括四元数这样的非交换半环。推导同样涵盖空的内维度：当 $n = 0$ 或 $p = 0$ 时，内层求和是空和 $0$，而对空和的右分配律就是吸收律 $0 \\cdot c = 0$（左分配律给出 $a \\cdot 0 = 0$），每个半环都具有这一性质。[^absorb] 对 $C = I$ 做同样的计算可得 $AI = A$，而乘积对矩阵加法的分配律由 $R$ 中的分配律逐元素得出。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:177
msgid "For rings absorption follows from distributivity, $0 \\cdot c = (0 + 0)c = 0 \\cdot c + 0 \\cdot c$; for semirings, which lack subtraction, it is an axiom."
msgstr "对于环，吸收律可由分配律推出：$0 \\cdot c = (0 + 0)c = 0 \\cdot c + 0 \\cdot c$；对于没有减法的半环，它是一条公理。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:181
msgid "Transpose"
msgstr "转置"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:183
msgid "The transpose is the map $(A^{\\mathsf T})_{ij} = A_{ji}$ from $R^{m \\times n}$ to $R^{n \\times m}$. It is total and"
msgstr "转置是从 $R^{m \\times n}$ 到 $R^{n \\times m}$ 的映射 $(A^{\\mathsf T})_{ij} = A_{ji}$。它是全函数，且"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:191
msgid "The product rule needs more. For composable $A$ and $B$:"
msgstr "乘积规则则需要更多条件。对可复合的 $A$ 和 $B$："

#: manual/design/algebra.md:201
msgid "The two sums agree term by term exactly when $A_{kj} B_{ji} = B_{ji} A_{kj}$, that is, when the scalars commute. So $(AB)^{\\mathsf T} = B^{\\mathsf T} A^{\\mathsf T}$ is a theorem for matrices over a commutative ring and false in general.[^conj] Transpose is a contravariant functor $\\mathbf{Mat}_R \\to \\mathbf{Mat}_R$ only in the commutative case."
msgstr "两个和式逐项相等，当且仅当 $A_{kj} B_{ji} = B_{ji} A_{kj}$，即标量可交换。因此 $(AB)^{\\mathsf T} = B^{\\mathsf T} A^{\\mathsf T}$ 对交换环上的矩阵是定理，一般情况下则不成立。[^conj] 只有在交换情形下，转置才是反变函子 $\\mathbf{Mat}_R \\to \\mathbf{Mat}_R$。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:207
msgid "For a ring with an involution $x \\mapsto \\bar{x}$ that reverses products, $\\overline{xy} = \\bar{y}\\,\\bar{x}$, the conjugate transpose $A^{*} = \\overline{A}^{\\mathsf T}$ does satisfy $(AB)^{*} = B^{*} A^{*}$ without commutativity, because each term becomes $\\overline{A_{kj} B_{ji}} = \\overline{B_{ji}}\\,\\overline{A_{kj}}$. This is why the concrete matrix types offer `adjoint` next to `transpose`."
msgstr "对于带有反转乘积的对合 $x \\mapsto \\bar{x}$（即 $\\overline{xy} = \\bar{y}\\,\\bar{x}$）的环，共轭转置 $A^{*} = \\overline{A}^{\\mathsf T}$ 无需交换性即满足 $(AB)^{*} = B^{*} A^{*}$，因为每一项都变成 $\\overline{A_{kj} B_{ji}} = \\overline{B_{ji}}\\,\\overline{A_{kj}}$。这就是具体矩阵类型在 `transpose` 之外还提供 `adjoint` 的原因。"

