#: manual/design/algebra.md:215
msgid "The traits are empty or have one observation method, so correctness is a property of each implementation. The laws an implementation promises are:"
msgstr "这些 trait 要么为空，要么只有一个观察方法，因此正确性是每个实现自身的性质。实现所承诺的定律是："

#: manual/design/algebra.md:218
#: manual/integration/container.md:9
msgid "Level"
msgstr "级别"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:218
msgid "Laws (whenever both sides are defined)"
msgstr "定律（只要两边都有定义）"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:220
msgid "abelian group laws; operations preserve shape"
msgstr "阿贝尔群定律；运算保持形状"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:221
msgid "$R^n$ is a ring under `+` and `*`: associativity, distributivity"
msgstr "$R^n$ 在 `+` 和 `*` 下是环：结合律、分配律"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:222
msgid "$\\operatorname{shape}(A^{\\mathsf T}) = \\operatorname{shape}(A)$ reversed; $(A^{\\mathsf T})^{\\mathsf T} = A$"
msgstr "$\\operatorname{shape}(A^{\\mathsf T}) = \\operatorname{shape}(A)$ 反转；$(A^{\\mathsf T})^{\\mathsf T} = A$"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:224
msgid "$(AB)C = A(BC)$; distributivity; $(AB)^{\\mathsf T} = B^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}$ if the scalars commute"
msgstr "$(AB)C = A(BC)$；分配律；若标量可交换，则 $(AB)^{\\mathsf T} = B^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}$"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:226
msgid "Two caveats apply to concrete scalar types."
msgstr "对具体的标量类型有两点需要注意。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:228
msgid "**Fixed-width integers.** `Int` is the ring $\\mathbb{Z}/2^{32}\\mathbb{Z}$, not $\\mathbb{Z}$. The laws above hold exactly in that ring, because wrapping addition and multiplication are the ring operations of $\\mathbb{Z}/2^{32}\\mathbb{Z}$; a matrix product that overflows is still the correct product modulo $2^{32}$."
msgstr "**定宽整数。** `Int` 是环 $\\mathbb{Z}/2^{32}\\mathbb{Z}$，而不是 $\\mathbb{Z}$。上述定律在该环中严格成立，因为回绕的加法和乘法正是 $\\mathbb{Z}/2^{32}\\mathbb{Z}$ 的环运算；溢出的矩阵乘积仍是模 $2^{32}$ 意义下正确的乘积。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:234
msgid "**Floating point.** `Float` and `Double` are not rings: addition is not associative under rounding. The laws hold only up to rounding error, and tests must compare with a tolerance. For an inner product of length $n$ computed in any order, the standard model $\\mathrm{fl}(x \\circ y) = (x \\circ y)(1 + \\delta)$, $|\\delta| \\le u$, gives"
msgstr "**浮点数。** `Float` 和 `Double` 不是环：在舍入下加法不满足结合律。这些定律只在舍入误差范围内成立，测试必须带容差比较。对于按任意顺序计算的长度为 $n$ 的内积，标准模型 $\\mathrm{fl}(x \\circ y) = (x \\circ y)(1 + \\delta)$，$|\\delta| \\le u$ 给出"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:245
msgid "entry-wise, where $u = 2^{-53}$ for `Double`.[^higham] Applying the bound twice, with inner dimensions $n$ and $p$,"
msgstr "逐元素成立，其中 `Double` 的 $u = 2^{-53}$。[^higham] 把这个界应用两次，内维度分别为 $n$ 和 $p$，"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:258
msgid "using $|\\mathrm{fl}(AB)| \\le (1 + \\gamma_n)|A|\\,|B|$ and $\\gamma_a + \\gamma_b + \\gamma_a\\gamma_b \\le \\gamma_{a+b}$ (Higham, Lemma 3.3). The same holds for $\\mathrm{fl}(A\\,\\mathrm{fl}(BC))$, so the two evaluation orders can differ by up to $2\\gamma_{n+p}\\,|A|\\,|B|\\,|C|$. This is the scale a tolerance-based comparison must allow."
msgstr "这里用到了 $|\\mathrm{fl}(AB)| \\le (1 + \\gamma_n)|A|\\,|B|$ 和 $\\gamma_a + \\gamma_b + \\gamma_a\\gamma_b \\le \\gamma_{a+b}$（Higham，引理 3.3）。对 $\\mathrm{fl}(A\\,\\mathrm{fl}(BC))$ 同样成立，因此两种求值顺序之差最多为 $2\\gamma_{n+p}\\,|A|\\,|B|\\,|C|$。这就是基于容差的比较必须允许的尺度。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:264
msgid "N. J. Higham, *Accuracy and Stability of Numerical Algorithms*, 2nd ed., SIAM, 2002, §3.1 and §3.5. The bound follows by applying the model to each of the $n - 1$ additions and $n$ multiplications of one inner product."
msgstr "N. J. Higham, *Accuracy and Stability of Numerical Algorithms*, 2nd ed., SIAM, 2002，§3.1 与 §3.5。对一次内积中的 $n - 1$ 次加法和 $n$ 次乘法分别应用该模型即可得到此界。"

