#: manual/design/algebra.md:270
msgid "**A `VectorSpace` or `Module` trait.** Rejected until scalar association can be expressed without fixing a scalar type; see the first decision."
msgstr "**`VectorSpace` 或 `Module` trait。** 在能够不固定标量类型地表达标量关联之前予以否决；见第一个决策。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:272
msgid "**A shape-dependent `zero(rows, cols)` method.** It would duplicate the upstream `Zero` trait with a different meaning and still could not serve generic code that does not know the shape."
msgstr "**依赖形状的 `zero(rows, cols)` 方法。** 它会以不同含义重复上游的 `Zero` trait，而且仍无法服务于不知道形状的泛型代码。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:275
msgid "**Inner products and norms as structure traits.** They map into the scalars, depend on the scalar type (a norm into `Double` is not a norm into `Int`), and have several reasonable choices. They stay backend methods."
msgstr "**把内积和范数作为结构 trait。** 它们映射到标量，依赖于标量类型（取值于 `Double` 的范数并不是取值于 `Int` 的范数），而且有多种合理选择。它们仍作为后端方法。"

#: manual/design/algebra.md:278
msgid "**One `Matrix` trait with every operation.** It would force partial multiplication and Hadamard products onto types that do not have them."
msgstr "**包含所有运算的单个 `Matrix` trait。** 它会把部分乘法和 Hadamard 积强加给不具备它们的类型。"

