#: manual/index.md:85
msgid "`immut`: `Matrix`, `Vector`, `MatrixFn`, the row accessor `Indexed`, the aliases `VecLib` and `VecCore`, and the top-level `lin_comb`"
msgstr "`immut`：`Matrix`、`Vector`、`MatrixFn`，行访问器 `Indexed`，别名 `VecLib` 和 `VecCore`，以及顶层函数 `lin_comb`"

#: manual/index.md:87
msgid "`mutable`: `Matrix`, `Vector`, the views `RowView`, `ColView`, `Transpose`, the row accessor `Lens`, the trait `Tolerance`, the re-exported `Sqrt`, and the top-level `identity` and `lin_comb`"
msgstr "`mutable`：`Matrix`、`Vector`，视图 `RowView`、`ColView`、`Transpose`，行访问器 `Lens`，trait `Tolerance`，重新导出的 `Sqrt`，以及顶层函数 `identity` 和 `lin_comb`"

#: manual/index.md:90
msgid "`backends/default`: `DenseMatrix`, `DenseVector`, `ImmutableDenseMatrix`, `ImmutableDenseVector`, and the generic helpers `matmul`, `transpose`, `shape_of`"
msgstr "`backends/default`：`DenseMatrix`、`DenseVector`、`ImmutableDenseMatrix`、`ImmutableDenseVector`，以及泛型辅助函数 `matmul`、`transpose`、`shape_of`"

#: manual/index.md:94
msgid "Numerical routines"
msgstr "数值例程"

#: manual/index.md:96
msgid "Exact (`immut`, over `Int`, `Int64`, `BigInt`): `determinant` by Bareiss elimination, `pow` by repeated squaring, `trace`, `matmul`"
msgstr "精确（`immut`，用于 `Int`、`Int64`、`BigInt`）：基于 Bareiss 消元的 `determinant`、基于反复平方的 `pow`、`trace`、`matmul`"

#: manual/index.md:98
msgid "Floating point (`mutable`, over `Float`, `Double`): `determinant`, `inverse`, `is_invertible` and `rank` by LU with partial pivoting, `reduce_row_elimination`, `cholesky_decomposition`, `is_positive_definite`, `eigen` for symmetric matrices, `power_method`, `mean`, `variance`, `std_dev`, `frobenius_norm`"
msgstr "浮点（`mutable`，用于 `Float`、`Double`）：基于部分选主元 LU 的 `determinant`、`inverse`、`is_invertible` 和 `rank`，以及 `reduce_row_elimination`、`cholesky_decomposition`、`is_positive_definite`、对称矩阵的 `eigen`、`power_method`、`mean`、`variance`、`std_dev`、`frobenius_norm`"

#: manual/index.md:103
msgid "Every operation with a runtime failure mode has a checked form returning `Result[_, LinearAlgebraError]` and an `unchecked_*` form that aborts"
msgstr "每个存在运行时失败情形的操作都有一个返回 `Result[_, LinearAlgebraError]` 的受检形式，以及一个会中止的 `unchecked_*` 形式"

#: manual/index.md:106
msgid "Capability layers"
msgstr "能力层"

#: manual/index.md:110
msgid "`container`: `VectorReadOps`, `VectorBuildOps`, `VectorPersistentEditOps`, `VectorMutableEditOps`, their `Matrix*` counterparts, and the algorithms `vector_map`, `vector_convert`, `matrix_map`, `matrix_convert`, `matrix_transpose`"
msgstr "`container`：`VectorReadOps`、`VectorBuildOps`、`VectorPersistentEditOps`、`VectorMutableEditOps`，它们对应的 `Matrix*` 版本，以及算法 `vector_map`、`vector_convert`、`matrix_map`、`matrix_convert`、`matrix_transpose`"

#: manual/index.md:114
msgid "`container/adapters`: one factory per type and capability, such as `mutable_matrix_read_ops`"
msgstr "`container/adapters`：每种类型、每种能力各一个工厂函数，例如 `mutable_matrix_read_ops`"

#: manual/index.md:117
msgid "Scalars and errors"
msgstr "标量与错误"

#: manual/index.md:119
msgid "`arithmetic`: `Abs`, `ApproxEq`, `CheckedDiv`, `CheckedSqrt`, `CheckedCompare`, and re-exports of `Zero`, `One`, `Inverse`, `Conjugate`, `Sqrt` and the other upstream scalar traits and types"
msgstr "`arithmetic`：`Abs`、`ApproxEq`、`CheckedDiv`、`CheckedSqrt`、`CheckedCompare`，以及重新导出的 `Zero`、`One`、`Inverse`、`Conjugate`、`Sqrt` 和其他上游标量 trait 与类型"

#: manual/index.md:122
msgid "`error`: `LinearAlgebraError`, `LinearAlgebraErrorKind`, constructors and `is_*` predicates"
msgstr "`error`：`LinearAlgebraError`、`LinearAlgebraErrorKind`、构造函数和 `is_*` 谓词"

#: manual/index.md:125
msgid "Numerical caveats"
msgstr "数值注意事项"

#: manual/index.md:127
msgid "The numerical routines of `mutable` decide \"zero\" with one absolute threshold, `Tolerance::tolerance()` $= 10^{-11}$, so their results depend on the scale of the input; scale data to order one (`eigen` is the exception: its decisions are relative to the entries). `@immut.Matrix::determinant` is meant for exact scalars, not for floating point. The [mutable design](design/mutable.md) and the [immut design](design/immut.md) derive the algorithms and state these limits precisely."
msgstr "`mutable` 的数值例程用一个绝对阈值 `Tolerance::tolerance()` $= 10^{-11}$ 判断“零”，因此结果依赖于输入的尺度；请把数据缩放到 1 的量级（`eigen` 例外：它的判断相对于矩阵元素）。`@immut.Matrix::determinant` 是为精确标量设计的，不适用于浮点。[mutable 设计](design/mutable.md)和 [immut 设计](design/immut.md)推导了这些算法，并精确说明了这些限制。"

#: manual/index.md:135
msgid "Where to read next"
msgstr "接下来读什么"

#: manual/index.md:137
msgid "New to the package: start with the [mutable tutorial](tutorial/mutable.md) for numerical work on `Double` matrices, or the [immut tutorial](tutorial/immut.md) for value semantics and exact integer results. Read the [error tutorial](tutorial/error.md) next, since every operation that can fail returns a `LinearAlgebraError`."
msgstr "初次接触本包：若要在 `Double` 矩阵上做数值计算，请从 [mutable 教程](tutorial/mutable.md)开始；若需要值语义和精确的整数结果，请从 [immut 教程](tutorial/immut.md)开始。接着阅读[错误教程](tutorial/error.md)，因为每个可能失败的操作都会返回 `LinearAlgebraError`。"

#: manual/index.md:142
msgid "Using it in a library: read the [algebra tutorial](tutorial/algebra.md) and the [backends/default tutorial](tutorial/backends/default.md) to write generic code, then the [container tutorial](tutorial/container.md) for moving data between representations, and the integration guides ([algebra](integration/algebra.md), [container](integration/container.md)) before publishing implementations for your own types. Keep the API pages at hand; each item lists its errors, edge cases and cost."
msgstr "在库中使用：阅读 [algebra 教程](tutorial/algebra.md)和 [backends/default 教程](tutorial/backends/default.md)以编写泛型代码，然后阅读 [container 教程](tutorial/container.md)了解如何在不同表示之间搬运数据；在为自己的类型发布实现之前，请阅读集成指南（[algebra](integration/algebra.md)、[container](integration/container.md)）。把 API 页面放在手边；每一项都列出了它的错误、边界情况和开销。"

#: manual/index.md:149
msgid "Contributing: read the [architecture guide](architecture.md), the [conventions](conventions.md), the design pages of the package you change, and the [internal](tutorial/internal.md) and [consistency](tutorial/consistency.md) tutorials. Benchmarks are covered by the [perf](tutorial/perf.md) pages."
msgstr "参与贡献：阅读[架构指南](architecture.md)、[约定](conventions.md)、所修改包的设计页面，以及 [internal](tutorial/internal.md) 和 [consistency](tutorial/consistency.md) 教程。基准测试见 [perf](tutorial/perf.md) 相关页面。"

