#: manual/integration/algebra.md:1
msgid "Algebra integration"
msgstr "Algebra 集成"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:3
msgid "The `algebra` package is for mathematical capabilities of whole vector and matrix objects. External libraries should implement only the traits whose operation meaning, closure, and ownership behavior match their types."
msgstr "`algebra` 描述向量和矩阵对象整体的数学能力。外部库只应实现运算含义、封闭性与所有权行为真正符合自身类型的 trait。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:7
msgid "Choose an algebra level"
msgstr "选择 Algebra 接入级别"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:9
msgid "Vector and matrix traits form separate capability paths:"
msgstr "向量 trait 与矩阵 trait 构成彼此独立的能力路径："

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:11
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:11
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:11
