msgstr "向量 2"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:15
msgid "`Mul` means element-wise/Hadamard multiplication"
msgstr "`Mul` 表示逐元素/Hadamard 乘法"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:16
msgid "Reports matrix dimensions"
msgstr "返回矩阵形状"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:17
msgid "Matrix 1"
msgstr "矩阵 1"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:17
msgid "Transpose returns the same matrix type"
msgstr "转置返回同一矩阵类型"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:18
msgid "Matrix 2"
msgstr "矩阵 2"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:18
msgid "Closed matrix addition, negation, and subtraction"
msgstr "在同一类型内完成矩阵加法、取负和减法"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:19
msgid "Matrix 3"
msgstr "矩阵 3"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:19
msgid "`Mul` means matrix multiplication"
msgstr "`Mul` 表示矩阵乘法"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:21
msgid "Stop at the smallest level required by downstream algorithms. Shape traits do not imply element access. `TransposeMatrix` does not imply matrix multiplication. `AdditiveVector` does not imply dot product, norm, scalar action, or element-wise multiplication."
msgstr "应停在下游算法需要的最小级别。Shape 不代表元素访问；`TransposeMatrix` 不代表矩阵乘法；`AdditiveVector` 不代表内积、范数、标量作用或逐元素乘法。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:26
msgid "Important operator boundary"
msgstr "运算符边界"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:28
msgid "The stronger traits reuse MoonBit operators and return `Self`, not `Result`. Before implementing one, confirm all of the following:"
msgstr "较强的 trait 复用 MoonBit 运算符并返回 `Self`，而不是 `Result`。实现前需要确认："

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:31
msgid "The operator already has the documented meaning for the type. In particular, `Mul` must not mean Hadamard multiplication on a `MatMulMatrix`."
msgstr "运算符已有含义与 trait 一致，尤其 `MatMulMatrix` 的 `Mul` 必须表示矩阵乘法。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:33
msgid "Results remain in the same concrete type."
msgstr "结果封闭在同一个具体类型中。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:34
msgid "Runtime shape preconditions and failure behavior are clearly documented."
msgstr "运行时形状前置条件及失败行为已经写入文档。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:35
msgid "The operation does not silently switch storage backends or ownership models."
msgstr "运算不会静默切换后端或所有权模型。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:37
msgid "Dynamic rectangular matrix multiplication may be invalid for some shape pairs. `MatMulMatrix` does not standardize a checked error channel for that case. A backend that needs a checked public operation should retain its checked method and implement `MatMulMatrix` only when its operator contract is acceptable."
msgstr "动态长方形矩阵可能因形状不兼容而无法相乘。`MatMulMatrix` 本身不定义受检错误通道。需要 checked API 的后端应保留自己的受检方法，并只在运算符契约合理时实现该 trait。"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:42
msgid "Algebra and container are independent"
msgstr "Algebra 与 Container 相互独立"

#: manual/integration/algebra.md:44
msgid "Need"
msgstr "需求"

