#: manual/tutorial/algebra.md:202
msgid "**Use the generic helpers of `backends/default`.** `@default.shape_of`, `@default.transpose` and `@default.matmul` are the trait-bounded versions of the three operations; they are convenient when you want a function value rather than a trait-qualified call."
msgstr "**使用 `backends/default` 的泛型辅助函数。** `@default.shape_of`、`@default.transpose` 和 `@default.matmul` 是这三种运算带 trait 约束的版本；当你需要函数值而不是带 trait 限定的调用时，它们很方便。"

#: manual/tutorial/algebra.md:207
msgid "**Combine with `container`.** The `algebra` traits describe whole-object operations and never expose elements. When an algorithm also needs to read or build individual entries, use the operation dictionaries of [`container`](container.md) alongside the trait bound; the two layers are independent."
msgstr "**与 `container` 结合使用。** `algebra` trait 描述整体对象运算，从不暴露元素。当算法还需要读取或构造单个元素时，请在 trait 约束之外配合使用 [`container`](container.md) 的操作字典；这两层相互独立。"

#: manual/tutorial/algebra.md:213
msgid "**Scalar requirements stay on the concrete types.** The traits do not mention the scalar type. If an algorithm needs scalar multiplication or a dot product, take the concrete type (`@default.DenseVector[T]` with `T : AddMonoid + Mul`) or pass the scalar operation in as a function."
msgstr "**标量要求留在具体类型上。** 这些 trait 不涉及标量类型。如果算法需要标量乘法或点积，请接收具体类型（`T : AddMonoid + Mul` 的 `@default.DenseVector[T]`），或把标量运算作为函数传入。"

#: manual/tutorial/algebra.md:218
msgid "**Checked products.** When failure must be a value, convert to a concrete type with a checked method, such as `@immut.Matrix::matmul`, which returns `Result[_, LinearAlgebraError]`. See the [error tutorial](error.md)."
msgstr "**受检乘积。** 当失败必须作为值返回时，请转换为具体类型并使用受检方法，例如返回 `Result[_, LinearAlgebraError]` 的 `@immut.Matrix::matmul`。参见[错误教程](error.md)。"

