#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:1
msgid "arithmetic tutorial"
msgstr "arithmetic 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to use the scalar operation traits of `arithmetic` in your own generic helpers: absolute values, approximate comparison, and checked division, square root and comparison that turn invalid inputs into values you can handle. The background is in the [arithmetic design](../design/arithmetic.md)."
msgstr "本教程演示如何在你自己的泛型辅助函数中使用 `arithmetic` 的标量运算 trait：绝对值、近似比较，以及把非法输入转为可处理的值的受检除法、平方根与比较。背景知识见 [arithmetic 设计](../design/arithmetic.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:10
msgid "take an absolute value generically"
msgstr "泛型地取绝对值"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:11
msgid "compare floating-point results"
msgstr "比较浮点结果"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:12
msgid "divide without producing infinities"
msgstr "做除法而不产生无穷"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:13
msgid "take a square root only on its domain"
msgstr "只在定义域内开平方"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:14
msgid "order values that may be NaN"
msgstr "给可能含 NaN 的值排序"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:15
msgid "use `Sqrt`, `Zero`, `One` from one import"
msgstr "用一次导入获得 `Sqrt`、`Zero`、`One`"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:15
msgid "the re-exports of `@la_arithmetic`"
msgstr "`@la_arithmetic` 的重新导出"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:32
msgid "A generic \"largest magnitude\" helper needs `Abs` and `Compare`:"
msgstr "一个泛型的“最大模”辅助函数需要 `Abs` 和 `Compare`："

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:57
msgid "Normalize a vector without dividing by zero"
msgstr "归一化向量时避免除以零"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:59
msgid "`CheckedDiv` reports a zero divisor as an error instead of producing infinities:"
msgstr "`CheckedDiv` 把零除数报告为错误，而不是产生无穷大："

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:92
msgid "For the all-zero input the first division is $0/0$, which is reported with kind `DomainError`."
msgstr "对全零输入，第一次除法是 $0/0$，会以 kind `DomainError` 报告。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:95
msgid "Take a square root only on its domain"
msgstr "只在定义域内开平方"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:118
msgid "A slightly negative variance is a typical rounding artifact of a one-pass formula; the checked call makes you decide what to do with it."
msgstr "略为负的方差是单遍公式中典型的舍入产物；受检调用让你自己决定如何处理它。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:121
msgid "Sort data that may contain NaN"
msgstr "对可能含 NaN 的数据排序"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:123
msgid "`checked_compare` fails on NaN, so you can detect unordered data before sorting:"
msgstr "`checked_compare` 在遇到 NaN 时失败，因此可以在排序之前检测出无序数据："

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:144
msgid "Compare results approximately"
msgstr "近似比较结果"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:146
msgid "`ApproxEq` is convenient for values of order one, such as entries of a normalized vector:"
msgstr "`ApproxEq` 适用于量级为一的值，例如归一化向量的元素："

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:175
msgid "**Your own scalar type.** All traits are `pub(open)`. A decimal or rational type can implement `Abs`, `ApproxEq` (for an exact type, simply `==`) and the checked traits; it then works with every helper written against them."
msgstr "**你自己的标量类型。** 所有 trait 都是 `pub(open)`。十进制或有理数类型可以实现 `Abs`、`ApproxEq`（对精确类型直接用 `==` 即可）以及受检 trait；之后它就能配合所有针对这些 trait 编写的辅助函数使用。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:179
msgid "**Errors in matrix code.** The matrix packages report scalar failures with `LinearAlgebraError::arithmetic_failure`, which wraps an `ArithmeticError`. A helper that mixes matrix and scalar steps can convert with that constructor; see the [error tutorial](error.md)."
msgstr "**矩阵代码中的错误。** 矩阵包用 `LinearAlgebraError::arithmetic_failure` 报告标量失败，它包装一个 `ArithmeticError`。混合了矩阵与标量步骤的辅助函数可以用该构造函数进行转换；参见[错误教程](error.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:184
msgid "**Upstream traits.** For transcendental functions and contextual arithmetic, use `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` directly; this package re-exports only the names listed on the [API page](../api/arithmetic.md)."
msgstr "**上游 trait。** 对超越函数和带上下文的算术，请直接使用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`；本包只重新导出 [API 页面](../api/arithmetic.md)上列出的名称。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:190
msgid "**Absolute tolerance at the wrong scale.** `approx_eq` on values around $10^{20}$ is effectively exact equality, and on values around $10^{-20}$ it accepts everything. Scale your data or use your own relative rule."
msgstr "**绝对容差用错了量级。** 对 $10^{20}$ 附近的值，`approx_eq` 实际上就是严格相等；对 $10^{-20}$ 附近的值，它接受一切。请对数据做缩放，或使用自己的相对规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:193
msgid "**Chaining approximate comparisons.** $a \\approx b$ and $b \\approx c$ do not imply $a \\approx c$."
msgstr "**串联近似比较。** $a \\approx b$ 与 $b \\approx c$ 并不蕴含 $a \\approx c$。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:195
msgid "**Expecting the context to change `Double` results.** The precision of `ArithmeticContext` is ignored for binary floating point."
msgstr "**期望上下文改变 `Double` 结果。** 对二进制浮点数，`ArithmeticContext` 的精度会被忽略。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:197
msgid "**`Abs` on `Int.MIN_VALUE`.** The result wraps and stays negative."
msgstr "**对 `Int.MIN_VALUE` 使用 `Abs`。** 结果会回绕，仍为负数。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:201
msgid "[arithmetic API](../api/arithmetic.md) for the exact rules of each trait."
msgstr "[arithmetic API](../api/arithmetic.md)：每个 trait 的确切规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:202
msgid "[arithmetic design](../design/arithmetic.md) for why `approx_eq` is not an equivalence relation."
msgstr "[arithmetic 设计](../design/arithmetic.md)：为什么 `approx_eq` 不是等价关系。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:204
msgid "[mutable tutorial](mutable.md) for the matrix routines that depend on `Sqrt` and `Tolerance`."
msgstr "[mutable 教程](mutable.md)：依赖 `Sqrt` 和 `Tolerance` 的矩阵例程。"

#: manual/tutorial/arithmetic.md:206
msgid "[Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) for the full scalar operation library."
msgstr "[Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)：完整的标量运算库。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:1
msgid "backends/default tutorial"
msgstr "backends/default 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to use the dense wrappers of `backends/default` as ready-to-run data for generic code written against the `algebra` traits, and how to step down to the full concrete API when you need it. The background is in the [backends/default design](../../design/backends/default.md)."
msgstr "本教程演示如何把 `backends/default` 的稠密包装类型用作现成的数据，供针对 `algebra` trait 编写的泛型代码使用，以及在需要时如何下沉到完整的具体 API。背景知识见 [backends/default 设计](../../design/backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:10
msgid "run generic code on dense data"
msgstr "在稠密数据上运行泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:11
msgid "use immutable data instead"
msgstr "改用不可变数据"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:12
msgid "compute a dot product or $Ax$"
msgstr "计算点积或 $Ax$"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:13
msgid "compute $xa + y$"
msgstr "计算 $xa + y$"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:14
msgid "reach the full concrete API"
msgstr "使用完整的具体 API"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:15
msgid "wrap an existing matrix without copying"
msgstr "不复制地包装已有矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:42
msgid "Run a generic algorithm on both wrappers"
msgstr "在两种包装类型上运行泛型算法"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:44
msgid "A helper written against `MatMulMatrix` accepts the mutable and the immutable wrapper alike:"
msgstr "针对 `MatMulMatrix` 编写的辅助函数同样接受可变和不可变的包装类型："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:64
msgid "Evaluate a linear model"
msgstr "计算线性模型"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:66
msgid "`matvec`, `dot` and `axpy` cover the common vector arithmetic of a linear model $y = W x + b$:"
msgstr "`matvec`、`dot` 和 `axpy` 涵盖了线性模型 $y = W x + b$ 中常见的向量算术："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:81
msgid "The last digit of `17.650000000000002` is rounding: $0.1^2 + 4.2^2$ is not exactly representable."
msgstr "`17.650000000000002` 的最后一位来自舍入：$0.1^2 + 4.2^2$ 无法被精确表示。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:84
msgid "Step down to the concrete API"
msgstr "下沉到具体 API"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:86
msgid "The wrappers expose only trait-level operations. Use `inner()` for anything else, for example a checked inverse:"
msgstr "包装类型只暴露 trait 层面的运算。其他功能请通过 `inner()` 使用，例如受检的求逆："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:100
msgid "Wrap an existing matrix without copying"
msgstr "不复制地包装已有矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:102
msgid "`from_backend` shares the inner value, so a later write is visible:"
msgstr "`from_backend` 共享内部值，因此之后的写入是可见的："

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:116
msgid "**Choosing a wrapper.** Use `DenseMatrix`/`DenseVector` when you will also use the in-place and numerical API of `@mutable` (views, decompositions, statistics). Use the `Immutable*` wrappers when values must not change after construction, for example when they are shared between parts of a program."
msgstr "**选择包装类型。** 如果还要使用 `@mutable` 的原地与数值 API（视图、分解、统计），请使用 `DenseMatrix`/`DenseVector`。如果值在构造后不得改变，例如要在程序的不同部分之间共享，请使用 `Immutable*` 包装类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:121
msgid "**Converting between wrappers.** The [`container` adapters](../container/adapters.md) have dictionaries for all four wrappers, so `matrix_convert` moves data between them."
msgstr "**在包装类型之间转换。** [`container` 适配器](../container/adapters.md)为全部四种包装类型提供了字典，因此 `matrix_convert` 可以在它们之间搬运数据。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:125
msgid "**Writing a new backend.** A sparse or fixed-size type should implement the `algebra` traits for itself, as in the [algebra tutorial](../algebra.md), rather than convert into these wrappers."
msgstr "**编写新的后端。** 稀疏或定长类型应当为自身实现 `algebra` trait（如 [algebra 教程](../algebra.md)所示），而不是转换成这些包装类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:131
msgid "**Expecting `DenseVector::from_array` to copy.** It shares the array, like `@mutable.Vector::from_array`. Copy first if the array is reused."
msgstr "**以为 `DenseVector::from_array` 会复制。** 它与 `@mutable.Vector::from_array` 一样共享数组。如果数组会被复用，请先复制。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:133
msgid "**Expecting `axpy` to update in place.** It returns a new vector."
msgstr "**以为 `axpy` 会原地更新。** 它返回新向量。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:134
msgid "**Multiplying incompatible shapes.** `*` and `matvec` abort; check shapes with `shape()` or use the checked methods of the inner type."
msgstr "**对不兼容的形状做乘法。** `*` 和 `matvec` 会中止；请用 `shape()` 检查形状，或使用内部类型的受检方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:136
msgid "**Looking for decompositions on the wrapper.** They are on `inner()`."
msgstr "**在包装类型上寻找分解。** 它们在 `inner()` 上。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:140
msgid "[backends/default API](../../api/backends/default.md)."
msgstr "[backends/default API](../../api/backends/default.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:141
msgid "[algebra tutorial](../algebra.md) for writing the generic side."
msgstr "[algebra 教程](../algebra.md)：编写泛型一侧的代码。"

#: manual/tutorial/backends/default.md:142
msgid "[mutable tutorial](../mutable.md) and [immut tutorial](../immut.md) for the wrapped types."
msgstr "[mutable 教程](../mutable.md)和 [immut 教程](../immut.md)：被包装的类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:1
msgid "consistency tutorial"
msgstr "consistency 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:3
msgid "This page is for contributors: it shows how to run the cross-package agreement tests and how to add one when you add an operation to both `immut` and `mutable`. The reasoning is in the [consistency design](../design/consistency.md)."
msgstr "本页面向贡献者：介绍如何运行跨包一致性测试，以及在向 `immut` 和 `mutable` 同时添加某个运算时如何添加测试。其中的道理见 [consistency 设计](../design/consistency.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:9
msgid "run the agreement tests"
msgstr "运行一致性测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:10
msgid "check a new operation in both packages"
msgstr "在两个包中检查一个新操作"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:10
msgid "a test comparing `to_array` of both results"
msgstr "比较两个结果的 `to_array` 的测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:11
msgid "check an algebraic law on random inputs"
msgstr "在随机输入上检查一条代数定律"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:11
msgid "a quickcheck property over small `Int` matrices"
msgstr "针对小 `Int` 矩阵的 quickcheck 性质"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:12
msgid "pin down an intended difference"
msgstr "固定一个有意的差异"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:12
msgid "a test of the documented behaviour"
msgstr "针对文档所述行为的测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:16
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下："

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:22
msgid "All tests run on the default target; the package has no target-specific code."
msgstr "所有测试都在默认目标上运行；该包没有目标专用代码。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:26
msgid "Add an agreement test"
msgstr "添加一致性测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:28
msgid "Build the same input in both packages, apply the operation, and compare a common observation. The shape of such a test, as it would appear in `src/consistency/core_wbtest.mbt`:"
msgstr "在两个包中构造相同的输入，应用该运算，再比较共同的观察结果。这类测试的形式如下，就像它出现在 `src/consistency/core_wbtest.mbt` 中那样："

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:44
msgid "Add a law as a property"
msgstr "以性质的形式添加定律"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:46
msgid "Use `quick_check_fn` with tuples of small integers, and return a `Bool` that compares both sides of the law in both packages. Integers keep the comparison exact."
msgstr "使用 `quick_check_fn` 配合由小整数组成的元组，返回一个 `Bool`，在两个包中比较定律两边。使用整数可以保持比较精确。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:50
msgid "The same idea works in your own code. This check, compiled with the manual, compares the two packages on a product:"
msgstr "同样的思路也适用于你自己的代码。下面这个随手册一起编译的检查，在一个乘积上比较两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:65
msgid "When an operation is intentionally different between the packages, add a test that states the difference and mention it in both API pages."
msgstr "当某个运算在两个包之间有意不同时，请添加一个说明该差异的测试，并在两个 API 页面中注明。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:70
msgid "**Comparing `Double` results with `==`.** Kernels sum in different orders; keep agreement tests on integers."
msgstr "**用 `==` 比较 `Double` 结果。** 各内核的求和顺序不同；一致性测试请保持使用整数。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:72
msgid "**Comparing `to_string` across element types.** Use `to_array` when the printed forms may differ only in formatting."
msgstr "**跨元素类型比较 `to_string`。** 当打印形式可能只在格式上不同时，请使用 `to_array`。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:77
msgid "[consistency API](../api/consistency.md) for the list of tests."
msgstr "[consistency API](../api/consistency.md)：测试列表。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:78
msgid "[immut API](../api/immut.md) and [mutable API](../api/mutable.md)."
msgstr "[immut API](../api/immut.md) 和 [mutable API](../api/mutable.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:1
msgid "container tutorial"
msgstr "container 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to move matrices and vectors between representations with the `container` algorithms, how to change the element type on the way, and how to make your own container type take part by writing two small operation dictionaries. The model behind it is in the [container design](../design/container.md)."
msgstr "本教程演示如何用 `container` 算法在不同表示之间搬运矩阵和向量，如何在搬运途中改变元素类型，以及如何通过编写两个小型操作字典让你自己的容器类型参与进来。其背后的模型见 [container 设计](../design/container.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:10
msgid "copy a matrix into another representation"
msgstr "把矩阵复制到另一种表示"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:11
msgid "convert and change the element type"
msgstr "转换并改变元素类型"

#: manual/tutorial/container.md:12
msgid "transpose into another representation"
msgstr "转置到另一种表示"

