#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:3
msgid "This page is for contributors who add a matrix operation to `immut` or `mutable` and need to validate its inputs. Downstream code cannot import `internal`; it sees the guards only through the public methods. The rules are in the [internal design](../design/internal.md)."
msgstr "本页面向需要向 `immut` 或 `mutable` 添加矩阵运算并校验其输入的贡献者。下游代码无法导入 `internal`；它只能通过公开方法看到这些守卫。规则见 [internal 设计](../design/internal.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:10
msgid "validate a new checked method"
msgstr "校验一个新的受检方法"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:10
msgid "the `ensure_*_checked` guards"
msgstr "`ensure_*_checked` 守卫"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:11
msgid "abort in the unchecked partner"
msgstr "在非受检的对应方法中中止"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:11
msgid "the `ensure_*` guards"
msgstr "`ensure_*` 守卫"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:12
msgid "check an index on access"
msgstr "在访问时检查索引"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:13
msgid "give my matrix type the guards"
msgstr "让我的矩阵类型可以使用这些守卫"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:13
msgid "implement `HasShape`"
msgstr "实现 `HasShape`"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:17
msgid "Inside the repository, import the package in `moon.pkg` and bring the guards into scope:"
msgstr "在仓库内部，在 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包，并把守卫引入作用域："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:35
msgid "Add a checked/unchecked pair"
msgstr "添加一对受检/非受检方法"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:37
msgid "Validate with the checked guard, then call the unchecked form, so the checked/unchecked law holds by construction:"
msgstr "先用受检守卫校验，再调用非受检形式，这样受检/非受检定律就按构造成立："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:63
msgid "Check indices on access"
msgstr "访问时检查索引"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:65
msgid "Use `ensure_row_in_bounds` when a row is selected and `ensure_index_in_bounds` before computing a storage offset; never test only the flat offset."
msgstr "选择行时使用 `ensure_row_in_bounds`，计算存储偏移之前使用 `ensure_index_in_bounds`；切勿只检查扁平偏移。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:69
msgid "Observe the result from outside"
msgstr "从外部观察结果"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:71
msgid "The public behaviour is what tests should pin down:"
msgstr "测试应当固定的是公开行为："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:92
msgid "New matrix-like types inside the repository implement `HasShape` once and get every guard. Keep error kinds and messages unchanged when refactoring: the [`consistency`](consistency.md) tests and downstream users rely on them."
msgstr "仓库内新的类矩阵类型只需实现一次 `HasShape`，即可获得所有守卫。重构时请保持错误类型和消息不变：[`consistency`](consistency.md) 测试和下游用户都依赖它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:98
msgid "**Calling the aborting guard in a checked method.** The checked method would abort instead of returning `Err`."
msgstr "**在受检方法中调用会中止的守卫。** 这样受检方法就会中止，而不是返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:100
msgid "**Checking after mutating.** In `mutable`, validate before the first write so that an error leaves the matrix unchanged."
msgstr "**修改之后才检查。** 在 `mutable` 中，请在第一次写入之前校验，使错误不会改变矩阵。"

