#~ msgid "Suggested flow"
#~ msgstr "建议流程"

#~ msgid "Reach for `algebra` when the mathematical meaning matters more than one backend helper."
#~ msgstr "当算法更关心“它需要什么数学结构”而不是“它跑在哪个后端上”时，优先从 `algebra` 开始。"

#~ msgid "Use traits such as `AdditiveVector`, `MatrixShape`, `TransposeMatrix`, and `MatMulMatrix` to state the required structure."
#~ msgstr "用 `AdditiveVector`、`MatrixShape`、`TransposeMatrix`、`MatMulMatrix` 这类 trait 表达结构需求。"

#~ msgid "Add narrower arithmetic-only constraints only when the algorithm truly needs a specific computable operation."
#~ msgstr "只有在算法确实需要某个可计算操作时，再补充更窄的 arithmetic 约束。"

#~ msgid "Practical guidance"
#~ msgstr "实践建议"

#~ msgid "Prefer the smallest structure that still matches the algorithm's mathematical meaning."
#~ msgstr "优先选择能准确表达算法意义的最小结构约束。"

#~ msgid "Keep backend-specific products, norms, or solve routines out of the core structure layer unless they can be expressed generically."
#~ msgstr "内积、范数、求解等后端或算法特化行为，不要随便塞进核心结构层。"

#~ msgid "Install the shared abstraction packages first:"
#~ msgstr "先把共享抽象层依赖装好："

#~ msgid "Small case: turn a signed residual into a penalty signal"
#~ msgstr "小案例：把带符号残差转成惩罚值"

#~ msgid "This case is small, but it captures the role of the `arithmetic` layer:"
#~ msgstr "这个例子很小，但正好体现了 `arithmetic` 层的职责："

#~ msgid "Start from a raw scalar value produced by a linear-algebra routine."
#~ msgstr "从线性代数流程里拿到一个原始标量值。"

#~ msgid "Ask only for the concrete operation you need, here `Abs`."
#~ msgstr "只声明当前真正需要的操作，这里是 `Abs`。"

#~ msgid "Convert the signed residual into a penalty value without claiming a richer algebraic structure."
#~ msgstr "把带符号残差转成惩罚值，而不额外声称它满足更强的代数结构。"

#~ msgid "That is the right fit when the algorithm needs a computable helper, not a full mathematical contract."
#~ msgstr "当算法需要的是“一个能算的操作”，而不是“完整数学结构”时，这就是最合适的分层。"

#~ msgid "Use `arithmetic` when the algorithm needs an operation such as `abs`, checked division, checked square root, or approximate comparison."
#~ msgstr "当算法需要 `abs`、受检除法、受检平方根、近似比较这类具体操作时，优先看 `arithmetic`。"

#~ msgid "Keep the requirement as narrow as possible so more scalar types can satisfy it."
#~ msgstr "约束尽量收窄，这样更多标量类型都能复用你的算法。"

#~ msgid "Move up to `algebra` only when the algorithm depends on a stronger structural meaning."
#~ msgstr "只有当算法依赖更强的结构语义时，再升级到 `algebra`。"

#~ msgid "Prefer existing `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` or `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` traits when they already express the operation."
#~ msgstr "如果 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 或 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 已经表达了该能力，优先复用上游 trait。"

#~ msgid "Add local linear-algebra-facing traits only when an upstream capability name is missing."
#~ msgstr "只有当上游缺少合适名称时，才补本地的线性代数能力 trait。"

#~ msgid "Do not use an arithmetic-only trait as a substitute for a stronger algebraic guarantee."
#~ msgstr "不要拿 arithmetic-only trait 去替代更强的代数保证。"

#~ msgid "Small case: accept the default dense backend without hard-wiring the algorithm"
#~ msgstr "小案例：使用默认稠密后端，但不把算法写死在具体实现上"

#~ msgid "This case demonstrates the intended role of the default backend layer:"
#~ msgstr "这个例子体现了默认后端层的正确用法："

#~ msgid "Construct a concrete dense matrix with `DenseMatrix`."
#~ msgstr "用 `DenseMatrix` 构造一个可直接上手的具体稠密矩阵。"

#~ msgid "Pass it into a helper that asks only for `MatrixShape`."
#~ msgstr "把它传给一个只要求 `MatrixShape` 能力的辅助函数。"

#~ msgid "Let `@default.shape_of` bridge the concrete wrapper and the public trait-oriented view."
#~ msgstr "通过 `@default.shape_of` 把具体包装类型和公开 trait 视图连起来。"

#~ msgid "That gives users a ready-to-use dense backend while still keeping new algorithms portable."
#~ msgstr "这样既给用户提供了开箱即用的默认后端，也保留了后续把算法迁移到其他后端的空间。"

#~ msgid "Start with `DenseMatrix`, `DenseVector`, `ImmutableDenseMatrix`, or `ImmutableDenseVector` when you want the repository's reference backend immediately."
#~ msgstr "当你想马上用仓库自带的参考实现时，从 `DenseMatrix`、`DenseVector`、`ImmutableDenseMatrix`、`ImmutableDenseVector` 开始。"

#~ msgid "Write new reusable helpers against `algebra` traits such as `MatrixShape`."
#~ msgstr "当你在写可复用算法时，优先让函数依赖 `MatrixShape` 这类 `algebra` trait。"

#~ msgid "Keep the backend wrapper at the boundary where concrete storage is actually chosen."
#~ msgstr "把具体存储和具体后端的选择，尽量留在最外层边界。"

#~ msgid "Use the default backend wrappers when you want a public dense implementation with straightforward constructors."
#~ msgstr "当你需要一个公开、直接、稠密的默认实现时，使用这些 default backend 包装类型。"

#~ msgid "Keep backend-specific products, norms, solve strategies, or decompositions in the backend or a dedicated algorithm layer unless they can be expressed as same-category structural operations."
#~ msgstr "标量值乘积、范数、求解策略、分解策略这类后端特化行为，除非能表达成同类结构操作，否则应留在后端层或专门算法层。"

#~ msgid "Treat `backends/default` as a bridge layer, not as the only place where generic linear algebra code should live."
#~ msgstr "把 `backends/default` 视作桥接层，而不是所有泛型线性代数代码的归宿。"

#~ msgid "Convert between existing backends"
#~ msgstr "在现有后端之间转换"

#~ msgid "This example copies a default mutable dense matrix into the default immutable dense representation. Later mutation of the source cannot affect the target."
#~ msgstr "这个示例把默认的可变稠密矩阵复制为默认的不可变稠密表示。之后修改源矩阵不会影响目标。"

#~ msgid "Use `matrix_map` instead when conversion also changes the scalar type."
#~ msgstr "如果还需要改变标量类型，请使用 `matrix_map`。"

#~ msgid "Small case: classify a failed inverse request"
#~ msgstr "小案例：给失败的求逆请求分类"

#~ msgid "This case models a caller that wants to recover differently from different matrix failures:"
#~ msgstr "这个例子模拟的是：调用方希望根据不同失败原因采取不同恢复策略。"

#~ msgid "Call a checked API that returns `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]`."
#~ msgstr "调用一个返回 `Result[..., LinearAlgebraError]` 的受检 API。"

#~ msgid "Branch on the error predicates instead of guessing from a message string."
#~ msgstr "通过错误谓词分支，而不是去猜测错误消息字符串。"

#~ msgid "Return a fallback diagnostic only when the failure does not match a known recovery path."
#~ msgstr "只有在不属于已知恢复路径时，才退回到通用诊断消息。"

#~ msgid "That keeps control flow stable even if the human-readable message changes."
#~ msgstr "这样即使人类可读的错误文案以后调整，控制流本身仍然稳定。"

#~ msgid "Use checked matrix APIs in user-facing or data-dependent code."
#~ msgstr "面向用户输入或运行时数据的代码，优先使用受检矩阵 API。"

#~ msgid "Match on `Ok` / `Err` as close as possible to the place where recovery decisions are made."
#~ msgstr "尽量在真正需要恢复决策的地方就地匹配 `Ok` / `Err`。"

#~ msgid "Use `is_dimension_mismatch`, `is_negative_exponent`, `is_empty_matrix`, `is_non_square_matrix`, and related predicates to drive control flow."
#~ msgstr "用 `is_dimension_mismatch`、`is_negative_exponent`、`is_empty_matrix`、`is_non_square_matrix` 等方法驱动控制流。"

#~ msgid "Use `message` for diagnostics, logs, or a final fallback error, not for control-flow parsing."
#~ msgstr "`message` 适合做诊断、日志和兜底提示，不适合做控制流解析。"

#~ msgid "Treat `ArithmeticFailure` as a boundary for scalar arithmetic errors coming from lower-level arithmetic packages."
#~ msgstr "把 `ArithmeticFailure` 当作下层算术包传播出来的边界错误。"

#~ msgid "Fall back to `unchecked_*` only when surrounding code has already guaranteed the required preconditions."
#~ msgstr "只有在外围逻辑已经保证前置条件时，才退回 `unchecked_*`。"

#~ msgid "Small case: blur a tiny ASCII sprite with a 3x3 kernel"
#~ msgstr "小案例：用 `3x3` 卷积核给微型 ASCII 字符画做模糊"

#~ msgid "This case shows a value-oriented matrix workflow that feels close to a real image-processing toy:"
#~ msgstr "这个案例展示了一个更接近真实用途的值语义矩阵流程："

#~ msgid "Store a tiny sprite as an intensity matrix."
#~ msgstr "先把一张很小的字符画写成亮度矩阵。"

#~ msgid "Rebuild a new matrix with `Matrix::make`, one blurred output cell at a time."
#~ msgstr "用 `Matrix::make` 一格一格重建输出矩阵。"

#~ msgid "Sample a 3x3 neighborhood with index reads such as `source[row][col]`."
#~ msgstr "用 `source[row][col]` 这样的索引读取 `3x3` 邻域。"

#~ msgid "Render the result back into visible ASCII output for a quick correctness check."
#~ msgstr "最后再把结果渲染回字符画，直接检查模糊效果是否符合预期。"

#~ msgid "Because the blur returns a new matrix, the original sprite stays available for comparison. That is often the nicest property of the immutable path when you want to inspect intermediate transforms."
#~ msgstr "因为模糊操作会返回一份新矩阵，所以原始字符画仍然保留下来，方便你对照输入和输出。这正是不可变矩阵在调试中间变换时很省心的一点。"

#~ msgid "Build matrices with `Matrix::from_2d_array`, `Matrix::make`, `Matrix::new`, or `Matrix::from_array`."
#~ msgstr "使用 `Matrix::from_2d_array`、`Matrix::make`、`Matrix::new` 或 `Matrix::from_array` 构造矩阵。"

#~ msgid "Use `Matrix::make` when every output cell depends on a neighborhood or stencil from the source matrix."
#~ msgstr "当每个输出单元都依赖源矩阵里的一个邻域或 stencil 时，优先用 `Matrix::make`。"

#~ msgid "Prefer checked `matmul`, `trace`, `determinant`, and `pow` when shape or domain failures can come from runtime data."
#~ msgstr "当形状或输入域可能来自运行时数据时，优先使用受检的 `matmul`、`trace`、`determinant` 和 `pow`。"

#~ msgid "Use `unchecked_*` only when surrounding code has already enforced the required preconditions."
#~ msgstr "只有在外层逻辑已经保证前置条件时，才使用 `unchecked_*`。"

#~ msgid "Use `MatrixFn` when a lazy functional matrix representation is more appropriate than materialized storage."
#~ msgstr "当惰性的函数式矩阵表示比物化存储更合适时，使用 `MatrixFn`。"

#~ msgid "Clamp or otherwise define your border policy explicitly when you write kernel-style transforms."
#~ msgstr "写卷积核风格的变换时，边界处理一定要显式写清楚；这里使用的是 edge clamp。"

#~ msgid "Prefer the immutable path when updates should remain explicit and old matrix values still need to be preserved for later steps."
#~ msgstr "当更新需要保持显式、而旧矩阵值还要在后续步骤中保留时，优先采用不可变矩阵路径。"

