#~ msgid "Perform normalization and scaling with `map_inplace` and `left_scale_inplace`."
#~ msgstr "在副本上用 `map_inplace` 和 `left_scale_inplace` 做归一化与放大。"

#~ msgid "Finish with `dot` once the vector is ready for scoring."
#~ msgstr "最后再用 `dot` 算出分数。"

#~ msgid "Use `v[i]` and `v[i] = x` for direct element access."
#~ msgstr "使用 `v[i]` 和 `v[i] = x` 直接访问或更新元素。"

